&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2758 - Account Manager, SEO - GCS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the creative transformation company. We use the power of creativity to build better futures for our people, planet, clients and communities. For more information, visit wpp.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP’s global media collective. In a world where media is everywhere and in everything, we bring the best platform, people, and partners together to create limitless opportunities for growth. For more information, visit wppmedia.com&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About EssenceMediacom: A Leading WPP Media Brand&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;EssenceMediacom&amp;nbsp;is a new breed of media agency. Grounded in analytics &amp;amp; insights and powered by data &amp;amp; technology, we believe in the power of media and creative to drive breakthroughs for the world’s best brands. We help clients understand the modern marketing paradox and discover the breakthroughs brands need to win with their consumers. We are designed for the new communications economy — built on data &amp;amp; technology, built for people &amp;amp; algorithms, built around diverse schools of thought, built to test &amp;amp; learn at scale, and, crucially, built to evolve.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a quick thinking, organised and versatile &lt;strong&gt;SEO Account Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to oversee the day-to-day project for &lt;strong&gt;Honda Motor Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for delivering best in class SEO/GEO solutions to our clients, managing multiple stakeholders as well as ensuring the best outputs, working alongside other members of the team. We are looking for someone who has experience working in competitive and performance driven sectors and are ready to take the next step.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Leading Collectively&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;Open&lt;/strong&gt; environment by&lt;em&gt; Balancing People and Client Experiences&lt;/em&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Cultivating Trust&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Championing Growth&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;and Development&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Mobilize the Enterprise&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role specific:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead day to day account management of SEO/GEO activities across Honda Motor Company, owning delivery from brief through to implementation and performance reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the SEO/GEO roadmap for your account(s), translating business objectives into prioritised activities across technical, content, and authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage day-to-day client and stakeholder communications, leading status calls, meeting notes, action tracking, and clear next steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead monthly/quarterly planning and forecasting, aligning deliverables to campaign calendars, product launches, and wider media activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track, monitor and report performance using Google Analytics (GA4), Google Search Console and third-party platforms; ensure KPI definitions, tagging requirements and reporting cadences are agreed and maintained.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities and risks from data (rank/visibility trends, CTR, crawl/indexation, content performance) and turn them into clear recommendations and prioritised tests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee technical SEO health across client sites (crawlability, indexation, site architecture, Core Web Vitals, structured data, redirects, canonicals, hreflang), raising tickets and tracking delivery with dev/IT teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support content strategy and on-page optimisation: keyword and intent research, briefing, metadata, internal linking, information architecture, and content refresh programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver GEO (Generative Engine Optimisation) best practice by advising on content formats, entity/structured data signals, and brand presence in AI-assisted search experiences, while monitoring changes in SERP/AI features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quality assure SEO deliverables prior to client submission (audits, reports, recommendations, briefs), ensuring accuracy, clarity, and alignment to brand and legal/compliance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee performance of all SEO/GEO activity and ensure learnings are incorporated into future plans; surface technical issues early and coordinate resolution across agency and client teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay on top of platform updates (Google and other search engines) and wider industry trends, proactively sharing implications, opportunities and recommended actions with the team and the client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Planning and other channel teams (e.g., content, social, PR, paid search) to ensure SEO is aligned to the wider media strategy and integrated into campaign planning and measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential personal qualities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly motivated and able to work and learn independently and as part of a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to take responsibility for own work and to make sure that others deliver in support of you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility - willingness to pick up tasks for others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quick to learn, and keen to develop&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Veeam is the Data and AI Trust Company, specializing in helping organizations ensure their data and AI are fully understood, secured, and resilient to enable the acceleration of safe AI at scale. As the market leader in both data resilience and data security posture management, Veeam is built for the convergence of identity, data, security, and AI risk. Headquartered in Seattle with offices in more than 30 countries, Veeam protects over 550,000 customers worldwide, who trust Veeam to keep their businesses running. Join us as we go fearlessly forward together, growing, learning, and making a real impact for some of the world’s biggest brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Lead at the forefront of AI &amp;amp; Data Resilience&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Veeam, we don’t just talk about the future of technology — we are actively shaping it. We are a global leader in data resilience, operating at the epicentre of the AI, cloud and security evolution. Our culture is built by forward-thinking technologists with heart: people who challenge convention, collaborate openly, and believe that great ideas can come from anywhere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining Veeam means being part of a business that combines the energy and agility of a start-up with the scale, credibility, and market leadership of a global technology powerhouse. We focus relentlessly on customer outcomes, empower our teams to own their destiny, and create an inclusive environment where every voice matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Why Veeam&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work at the heart of AI-driven data resilience, enjoy flexibility and outcome-based performance, and lead with autonomy in a globally recognized organization that invests deeply in its people, culture, and leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a pivotal growth role within Veeam’s UK &amp;amp; Ireland organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Lead Account Executive, Enterprise you will be responsible for a book of existing key customers in the Defense sector, Public accounts and a set of target enterprise accounts to hunt and close net new logo acquisition. You will drive a daily rhythm to ensure in quarter execution and build forward pipeline. You will develop a clear point of view on the market and a constant curiosity to link corporate objectives and technology initiatives with customer and partners alike. You will set and manage the strategy for your Territory working with specialist teams in the UK &amp;amp; Ireland and Inside Sales and Sales Development teams based in Bucharest.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Director of Enterprise, UK &amp;amp; Ireland, you will play a central role in shaping how Veeam engages customers, partners, and the market — accelerating growth while building a culture of excellence, collaboration, and innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the vision for your UK &amp;amp; Ireland Enterprise Territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate virtual, geographically distributed teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive disciplined sales execution across the full Veeam portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accelerate growth in hybrid cloud and cloud-native environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build executive-level relationships with senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge the status quo with bold, innovative ideas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Channel, Hyperscalers, and System Integrators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sustained revenue growth and increased wallet share&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong operational excellence and predictable execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-trust, high-performance sales culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, long-term customer and partner relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A future-ready, scalable Enterprise Territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a seasoned Enterprise Sales Account Manager with presence, energy, and ambition. You bring a proven track record of leading go-to-market strategy and execution in complex technology environments, deep understanding of data resilience and cloud ecosystems, and an inspirational style to coordinate and excite virtual teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in business or technical discipline (or equivalent experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant sales experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of exceeding quota and KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in enterprise software, SaaS, or cloud organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 paid vacation days, plus 4 extra global VeeaMe Days for self-care and 24 paid volunteer hours annually through Veeam Cares&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical, dental, and vision insurance with dependent enrolment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance with enhanced coverage and global 24/7 protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Income protection after 26 weeks, covering a portion of salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defined contribution pension plan with employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Worldwide travel insurance for business and leisure, with option to enroll dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program with therapy, legal, and financial support, plus online GP services and wellbeing programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to learn and grow through on-demand libraries (LinkedIn Learning, O’Reilly), mentoring, workshops and learning events like our annual Global Day of Learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;If an applicant is permanently located outside of the United Kingdom, Veeam reserves the right to decline the application for this position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-AF1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 [&amp;quot;ul&amp;quot;,null,&amp;quot;li&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;style&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;checked&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;value&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;displayValue&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;backgroundColor&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;color&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;listStyleType&amp;quot;:null}]&quot; data-en-clipboard=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;56095010243a&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Veeam Software is an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt; and does not tolerate discrimination in any form on the basis of race, color, religion, gender, age, national origin, citizenship, disability, veteran status or any other classification protected by federal, state or local law. All your information will be kept confidential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Personal data collected during the recruitment process will be processed in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.veeam.com/legal/recruiting-privacy-notice.html&quot;&gt;Recruiting Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;, which explains how your information is collected, used, and handled in connection with hiring activities. By applying for this position, you consent to this processing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you confirm that the information provided, including any supporting documents, is complete and accurate to the best of your knowledge. Any misrepresentation, omission, or falsification may result in disqualification from consideration or, if discovered after employment begins, termination of employment.&lt;/p&gt;
