&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose of Position&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Awin&#39;s Unlock the Clock (UTC) programme is building the evidence base and infrastructure to move measurement beyond last click, using deterministic, CDN/edge-level signals and advanced data connections from publishers to show the full-funnel and AI-discovery influence that today&#39;s attribution misses. The value of that dataset scales with the quality and scale of the publishers inside it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role exists to acquire and retain those publishers. The Senior Partnerships Manager, Media &amp;amp; Data owns the end-to-end pursuit of medium-to-large global media publications and publisher groups, from first conversation to signature, to live, verified data flowing, and is responsible for building the commercial value exchange that makes Awin the leading partner for a premium publisher to work with. The focus in year one is a small number of flagship, tier-one lighthouse partnerships that prove the model and become the reference cases the rest of the market follows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a new, dedicated role. It is not general publisher account management: the postholder is hired to spearhead these relationships and nothing else.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Land flagship media partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and own a global target list of medium-to-large media publications and publisher groups whose audience, content and commerce activity make them high-value contributors to Awin’s deterministic dataset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full pursuit cycle for those targets: identify, qualify, pitch, negotiate, close and hand into onboarding, personally leading senior conversations with commercial, ecommerce, editorial and digital leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver a defined number of tier-one lighthouse partnerships in year one: signed tracking addendum, technically onboarded, and verifiably recording events at agreed volume and quality thresholds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Convert those wins into reference cases, including case studies, joint narratives and referenceable contacts, that materially shorten the sales cycle for the next tranche of publishers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the publisher value proposition&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and continuously sharpen the answer to “what’s in it for the publisher”: the commercial, editorial and strategic reasons a premium media owner shares CDN and wider data signals with Awin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Construct and negotiate the value exchange, including new revenue lines, advertiser demand, insight and benchmarking, or commercial terms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Product, Marketing and the workstream owners to translate AI-visibility and full-funnel capability into publisher-facing propositions, collateral and retailer pricing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help each partner build their own value proposition, so the publisher has something new and differentiated to sell to advertisers, not simply a new tag on their site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equip partners to sell that proposition through joint collateral, benchmarks, proof points and training for their commercial and editorial teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed publisher objections, commercial expectations and market intelligence back into the project roadmap so the product earns the deals rather than the deals stretching the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the technical and contractual path to live&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the integration conversation with publishes, covering CDN/edge worker or plugin deployment, tag and consent implications, data scope and page performance, with Awin product brought in for deep technical detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the commercial and legal process end to end, including tracking addendum, data-sharing terms, privacy and consent positions, working with Legal and Privacy to reach repeatable rather than bespoke agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold partners accountable to going live and staying live, tracking signed-to-verified-event conversion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global reach and internal leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate globally from day one across UK, EU and US, coordinating with local Awin market and Publisher Development teams and identified regional representatives rather than duplicating them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the single point of accountability and internal voice for media partner acquisition within the project: represent the workstream in relevant forums and provide clear, honest pipeline and progress reporting to SteerCo level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the advertiser-facing teams so publisher supply and advertiser demand are sequenced together: the data has to be sold on as well as signed up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Awin externally at key industry events, conferences and partner forums to promote Unlock the Clock and Awin’s fuller-funnel measurement strategy to the media community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the playbook: document what works, so the model can be scaled by others and, in time, by a small team reporting into this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Success measures (first 12 months)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Signed and live tier-one lighthouse partnerships against an agreed target, evidenced by verified event volume&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A qualified, weighted global pipeline of medium-to-large media groups with credible forward visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A repeatable publisher proposition and commercial framework: not a series of bespoke negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner-facing value propositions live in market, with at least two partners actively selling an Awin-enabled proposition of their own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Referenceable partners willing to advocate publicly, at least one flagship case study in market, and Awin represented on stage at relevant industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measurable advertiser-side pull-through from the partnerships landed, agreed jointly with the advertiser teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in commercial, partnership or account leadership roles, with a significant portion earned publisher-side or media-owner-side.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An established personal network of senior contacts across the media and publishing world that can be activated from day one. This is a prerequisite, not a nice-to-have.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience representing an organisation publicly: speaking at industry events, on panels or at partner forums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable track record of senior-level relationships inside premium publishers or media groups, including commercial directors, heads of ecommerce, editorial and digital leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience negotiating and closing commercial agreements with, or on behalf of, publishers: tenancy, CPC, CPA, fixed fee, data or licensing deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of the affiliate and performance ecosystem and how publishers monetise content, for example Awin, Skimlinks, Rakuten, Partnerize, Impact or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling or landing something new, a product, model or proposition without an established category, rather than managing an existing book of business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable navigating multi-stakeholder deals spanning commercial, editorial, legal, privacy and technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International exposure across at least two of UK, US and DACH/EMEA markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desirable: experience with content licensing, AI/LLM discovery, SEO/AEO, or data partnership deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially creative, able to construct a value exchange where no price list exists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relationship builder with genuine credibility at senior level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong negotiator, comfortable with ambiguity and long sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent storyteller: can turn technical capability into a publisher-relevant revenue narrative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident, credible public speaker, comfortable on stage and in front of a room as a visible advocate for Awin’s strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starting and resilient. This is a build role, not a maintain role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and low-ego; comfortable pulling in engineering, legal, product and local market teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytically confident: fluent in performance data, able to interrogate reporting and defend a number.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic mindset paired with a bias to action and closing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technically literate rather than technical: able to hold a credible conversation about tags, tracking, CDNs and edge/worker deployments, page performance and data flows, and to know when to bring engineering into the room.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident with analytics and reporting platforms, including GA4, publisher analytics, BI dashboards and Excel or Sheets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with privacy and consent concepts, including GDPR and consent frameworks, as they affect publisher data sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English essential. German or another European language advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel to relevant markets as required&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;RichTextList-bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexi-Week&lt;/strong&gt;: We prioritise your mental health and wellbeing by offering you a four-day Flexi-Week (with one lighter or completely disconnected day per week) at full pay, with no reduction to your annual holiday allowance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexi-Office&lt;/strong&gt;: We offer an international culture and flexibility through our hybrid working model, designed to foster collaboration, trust, and autonomy.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Expense Contribution &amp;amp; Remote Working Furniture&lt;/strong&gt;: You will receive a monthly allowance to cover part of your running costs, as well as a furniture package to support you in setting up a comfortable workspace at home.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;: Comprehensive coverage for a range of health benefits.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In addition, you’ll benefit from our global offering, including health and wellbeing initiatives, learning and development via Awin Academy, and peer-to-peer recognition programmes.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Established in 2000, Awin is proud of our dynamic, social and inclusive culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Like all businesses, we’ve had to adapt and nurture our culture in a virtual environment. Our virtual ‘Life @ Awin’ hub brings our colleagues from across the globe together for various social activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion are paramount to us, and we proudly pursue and hire diverse team members. We champion uniqueness and authenticity; this is who we are at our core. Our network of affiliate partnerships are diverse and transparent, as are the employees powering our vision to build the world’s leading open partner ecosystem. We welcome all backgrounds, identities, and experiences. If you need support at any point in the application or interview process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot;&gt;Awin is part of the Axel Springer group.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot;&gt;Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;Hyperlink SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; href=&quot;https://www.axelspringer.com/en/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight Underlined SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;axelspringer.com/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;en&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot;&gt;, and explore the Axel Springer Essentials here:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;Hyperlink SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; href=&quot;https://www.axelspringer.com/en/inside/the-essentials-what-we-have-adapted-and-why&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight Underlined SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;axelspringer.com/en/inside/the-essentials-what-we-have-adapted-and-why&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW55218471 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply now to begin the next stage of your career at a progressive company that supports both your professional and personal development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Partners Solutions Architect on Anthropic&#39;s Applied AI team, you&#39;ll be a pre-sales architect focused on building technical relationships with our Global and Regional System Integrators (GSIs/RSIs) and cloud partners (AWS and GCP). You&#39;ll strengthen these relationships to accelerate indirect revenue, enable partners&#39; AI practices, and execute our long-term go-to-market strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic technical partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a technical thought partner to the Anthropic GTM partnerships team. Bring technical expertise to help us understand the partner landscape, drive key strategic programs, and find ways to deepen partner technical capabilities. Embed with GSI and cloud partner technical teams to enable their AI practices, support troubleshooting, and evangelize Anthropic in their developer communities. You&#39;ll also serve as an escalation point for complex technical issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Joint solution development:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with partners to identify high-value, industry-specific GenAI applications, develop joint solutions, and codify reference architectures and best practices that speed time to deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer deal support:&lt;/strong&gt; Step in to unblock strategic customer deals where partners are the primary delivery vehicle, providing deep technical expertise and solution architecture guidance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner ecosystem and events:&lt;/strong&gt; Represent Anthropic at partner events such as GSI customer workshops, AWS summits, and industry conferences. Lead or support partner-specific developer events, hackathons, and technical enablement sessions, especially for technically native communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product feedback:&lt;/strong&gt; Gather and validate feedback on Anthropic&#39;s products and offerings, especially as they relate to partner use cases and deployment patterns. Deliver it to the relevant Anthropic teams to inform the product roadmap and partner strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You may be a good fit if you have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5+ years in technical customer-facing or partner-facing roles, such as Solutions Architect, Sales Engineer, Partner Sales Engineer, or Technical Account Manager&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A track record of partnering successfully with GSIs and/or cloud providers to solve complex technical challenges, from initial solution design through customer delivery&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exceptional ability to build relationships and communicate technical concepts to diverse stakeholders, including C-suite executives and engineering and IT teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong presentation and technical communication skills, with the ability to translate requirements between technical and business stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience designing scalable cloud architectures and integrating with enterprise systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with common LLM frameworks and tools, or a background in machine learning or data science&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enthusiasm for cross-organizational collaboration, working through trade-offs, and balancing competing priorities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A love of teaching, mentoring, and helping others succeed&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A passion for using technology in ways that are safe and beneficial, and that advance the goal of safe AI systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual compensation range for this role is listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For sales roles, the range provided is the role’s On Target Earnings (&quot;OTE&quot;) range, meaning that the range includes both the sales commissions/sales bonuses target and annual base salary for the role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£150,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£190,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s degree or an equivalent combination of education, training, and/or experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required field of study:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;A field relevant to the role as demonstrated through coursework, training, or professional experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum years of experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Years of experience required will correlate with the internal job level requirements for the position&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location-based hybrid policy:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently, we expect all staff to be in one of our offices at least 25% of the time. However, some roles may require more time in our offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Visa sponsorship:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We do sponsor visas! However, we aren&#39;t able to successfully sponsor visas for every role and every candidate. But if we make you an offer, we will make every reasonable effort to get you a visa, and we retain an immigration lawyer to help with this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We encourage you to apply even if you do not believe you meet every single qualification.&lt;/strong&gt; Not all strong candidates will meet every single qualification as listed.&amp;nbsp; Research shows that people who identify as being from underrepresented groups are more prone to experiencing imposter syndrome and doubting the strength of their candidacy, so we urge you not to exclude yourself prematurely and to submit an application if you&#39;re interested in this work. We think AI systems like the ones we&#39;re building have enormous social and ethical implications. We think this makes representation even more important, and we strive to include a range of diverse perspectives on our team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Your safety matters to us.&lt;/strong&gt; To protect yourself from potential scams, remember that Anthropic recruiters only contact you ----- addresses. In some cases, we may partner with vetted recruiting agencies who will identify themselves as working on behalf of Anthropic. Be cautious of emails from other domains. Legitimate Anthropic recruiters will never ask for money, fees, or banking information before your first day. If you&#39;re ever unsure about a communication, don&#39;t click any links—visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u data-stringify-type=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;anthropic.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;directly for confirmed position openings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we&#39;re different&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that the highest-impact AI research will be big science. At Anthropic we work as a single cohesive team on just a few large-scale research efforts. And we value impact — advancing our long-term goals of steerable, trustworthy AI — rather than work on smaller and more specific puzzles. We view AI research as an empirical science, which has as much in common with physics and biology as with traditional efforts in computer science. We&#39;re an extremely collaborative group, and we host frequent research discussions to ensure that we are pursuing the highest-impact work at any given time. As such, we greatly value communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The easiest way to understand our research directions is to read our recent research. This research continues many of the directions our team worked on prior to Anthropic, including: GPT-3, Circuit-Based Interpretability, Multimodal Neurons, Scaling Laws, AI &amp;amp; Compute, Concrete Problems in AI Safety, and Learning from Human Preferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come work with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is a public benefit corporation headquartered in San Francisco. We offer competitive compensation and benefits, optional equity donation matching, generous vacation and parental leave, flexible working hours, and a lovely office space in which to collaborate with colleagues. &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Guidance on Candidates&#39; AI Usage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learn about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;our policy&lt;/a&gt; for using AI in our application process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Applied AI Engineer on our Enterprise team, your role is to guide some of the UK&#39;s largest businesses to the frontier of AI and help them deploy Claude into their operations, their products, and their ways of working. You will become the go-to Claude Platform specialist and trusted technical advisor for your customers, advising their engineering teams on architecture, agent design, and evaluation, and working with the C-level and senior executives who sponsor these programmes to show the business value Claude can create and help them reach a confident decision to build on Claude.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enterprise deals are different. Procurement cycles are longer, more stakeholders are involved, and success depends on being able to connect the technical work to the outcomes the boardroom cares about. You will be as comfortable advising an engineering team on evaluation and architecture as you are presenting a value case to a CIO or CTO, and you will carry the technical thread across every stage of a multi-quarter engagement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will partner closely with Enterprise Account Executives and Applied AI Architects to take each customer from first conversation, through technical evaluation, proof of value and procurement, to the decision to build on Claude. Once they have decided, you set their systems integration partner up to deliver, agreeing the target architecture and what good looks like, and you stay close as the customer&#39;s technical advisor on Claude throughout deployment, while the partner does the build. Working alongside Anthropic&#39;s Product and Engineering teams, you will use your knowledge of the Claude Platform to advise on evaluation, recommend architectures that meet enterprise security and scale requirements, and create the technical and business resources that help large organisations succeed with Claude.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Enterprise Account Executives and Applied AI Architects to take UK enterprise customers from first conversation, through technical evaluation, proof of value and procurement, to the decision to build on Claude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the technical side of each opportunity, then remain the customer&#39;s technical advisor on Claude as they deploy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set customers and their systems integration partners up to deliver: agree the target architecture, define what good looks like, and advise the delivery team as the build progresses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help customer engineering teams see how they would build on Claude, covering architecture, agent design and evaluation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and present the business value case for Claude to C-level and senior executives, linking technical capabilities to measurable outcomes such as cost, revenue, risk, and time to market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide customers through long, multi-stakeholder procurement, including security and architecture reviews and a clear path to production, navigating security, compliance, data residency and governance requirements (including UK GDPR)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed patterns from enterprise engagements back to Product, Engineering, and the wider Applied AI team, and travel to customer sites across the UK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a good fit if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience as a Software Engineer, Solutions Architect, Forward Deployed Engineer, or technical founder&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pre-sales or technical advisory experience selling into large enterprises, ideally in the UK, including owning the technical win (evaluations, proofs of concept, due diligence with security, legal and procurement)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with value-based selling and presenting a business case to C-level and VP-level stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production experience with LLM-powered applications, including prompting, context engineering, agent architectures, evaluation frameworks, and deployment at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with enterprise security, compliance, and architecture requirements, ideally in regulated sectors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to explain complex AI concepts clearly to both technical and executive audiences, and a passion for making powerful technology safe and beneficial&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual compensation range for this role is listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For sales roles, the range provided is the role’s On Target Earnings (&quot;OTE&quot;) range, meaning that the range includes both the sales commissions/sales bonuses target and annual base salary for the role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£225,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£255,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s degree or an equivalent combination of education, training, and/or experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required field of study:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;A field relevant to the role as demonstrated through coursework, training, or professional experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum years of experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Years of experience required will correlate with the internal job level requirements for the position&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location-based hybrid policy:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently, we expect all staff to be in one of our offices at least 25% of the time. However, some roles may require more time in our offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Visa sponsorship:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We do sponsor visas! However, we aren&#39;t able to successfully sponsor visas for every role and every candidate. But if we make you an offer, we will make every reasonable effort to get you a visa, and we retain an immigration lawyer to help with this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We encourage you to apply even if you do not believe you meet every single qualification.&lt;/strong&gt; Not all strong candidates will meet every single qualification as listed.&amp;nbsp; Research shows that people who identify as being from underrepresented groups are more prone to experiencing imposter syndrome and doubting the strength of their candidacy, so we urge you not to exclude yourself prematurely and to submit an application if you&#39;re interested in this work. We think AI systems like the ones we&#39;re building have enormous social and ethical implications. We think this makes representation even more important, and we strive to include a range of diverse perspectives on our team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Your safety matters to us.&lt;/strong&gt; To protect yourself from potential scams, remember that Anthropic recruiters only contact you ----- addresses. In some cases, we may partner with vetted recruiting agencies who will identify themselves as working on behalf of Anthropic. Be cautious of emails from other domains. Legitimate Anthropic recruiters will never ask for money, fees, or banking information before your first day. If you&#39;re ever unsure about a communication, don&#39;t click any links—visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u data-stringify-type=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;anthropic.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;directly for confirmed position openings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we&#39;re different&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that the highest-impact AI research will be big science. At Anthropic we work as a single cohesive team on just a few large-scale research efforts. And we value impact — advancing our long-term goals of steerable, trustworthy AI — rather than work on smaller and more specific puzzles. We view AI research as an empirical science, which has as much in common with physics and biology as with traditional efforts in computer science. We&#39;re an extremely collaborative group, and we host frequent research discussions to ensure that we are pursuing the highest-impact work at any given time. As such, we greatly value communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The easiest way to understand our research directions is to read our recent research. This research continues many of the directions our team worked on prior to Anthropic, including: GPT-3, Circuit-Based Interpretability, Multimodal Neurons, Scaling Laws, AI &amp;amp; Compute, Concrete Problems in AI Safety, and Learning from Human Preferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come work with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is a public benefit corporation headquartered in San Francisco. We offer competitive compensation and benefits, optional equity donation matching, generous vacation and parental leave, flexible working hours, and a lovely office space in which to collaborate with colleagues. &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Guidance on Candidates&#39; AI Usage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learn about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;our policy&lt;/a&gt; for using AI in our application process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Applied AI Engineer on our Digital Native Business team, you&#39;ll help fast-growing, tech-forward companies build their products on Claude. You&#39;ll be the technical advisor their engineering teams turn to for architecture, agent design and evaluation, and you&#39;ll work alongside them, pair programming and reviewing architectures, to get from first prototype to production at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll partner with Account Executives and Applied AI Architects to take each customer from first conversation through technical evaluation and proof of value to a confident decision to build on Claude, then stay close as they ship and scale. These customers move quickly and expect you to have built things yourself, so you&#39;ll be at your best in the code and the architecture review, not just the meeting. Alongside Anthropic&#39;s Product and Engineering teams, you&#39;ll develop custom evaluation frameworks, prototypes and reference architectures, and turn what you learn across engagements into technical content and product feedback that helps other builders succeed with Claude.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serve as a deep technical advisor to high-growth, tech-forward companies, working alongside them to build innovative use cases that push the boundaries of AI&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work hands-on with customer engineering teams: pair programming, architecture reviews, and code contributions that accelerate their development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop prototypes and technical documentation—including evaluation suites, AI engineering techniques, and architecture diagrams—that enable customers to build and scale with Claude&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate closely with Applied AI Architects to maintain context and continuity across customer engagements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify patterns across engagements and contribute insights back to Product, Engineering, and the broader Applied AI team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create technical content for developer audiences including documentation, tutorials, and sample code&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Foster community engagement through hackathons, webinars, technical office hours, and developer-focused events&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Travel to customer sites for workshops, implementation support, and relationship building&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a good fit if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;4+ years of experience as a Software Engineer, Forward Deployed Engineer, or technical founder&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in a customer-facing or pre-sales technical role - partnering with customers to scope, design, and deliver solutions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Production experience building LLM-powered applications, including prompting, context engineering, agent architectures, evaluation frameworks, and deployment at scale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong programming skills with proficiency in Python and experience building production applications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working with high-growth, tech-forward companies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to context-switch across industries (healthcare, fintech, etc.) and use cases&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Builder credibility that earns trust with technical founders and engineering leaders - you&#39;ve shipped products and can speak from experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong technical communication skills with the ability to translate complex AI concepts into architectural decisions and actionable implementation plans&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience facilitating technical workshops, hackathons, or developer-focused events&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Passion for making powerful technology safe and beneficial&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual compensation range for this role is listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For sales roles, the range provided is the role’s On Target Earnings (&quot;OTE&quot;) range, meaning that the range includes both the sales commissions/sales bonuses target and annual base salary for the role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£225,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£255,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s degree or an equivalent combination of education, training, and/or experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required field of study:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;A field relevant to the role as demonstrated through coursework, training, or professional experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum years of experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Years of experience required will correlate with the internal job level requirements for the position&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location-based hybrid policy:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently, we expect all staff to be in one of our offices at least 25% of the time. However, some roles may require more time in our offices.&lt;/p&gt;
