&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we&#39;re different&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that the highest-impact AI research will be big science. At Anthropic we work as a single cohesive team on just a few large-scale research efforts. And we value impact — advancing our long-term goals of steerable, trustworthy AI — rather than work on smaller and more specific puzzles. We view AI research as an empirical science, which has as much in common with physics and biology as with traditional efforts in computer science. We&#39;re an extremely collaborative group, and we host frequent research discussions to ensure that we are pursuing the highest-impact work at any given time. As such, we greatly value communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The easiest way to understand our research directions is to read our recent research. This research continues many of the directions our team worked on prior to Anthropic, including: GPT-3, Circuit-Based Interpretability, Multimodal Neurons, Scaling Laws, AI &amp;amp; Compute, Concrete Problems in AI Safety, and Learning from Human Preferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come work with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is a public benefit corporation headquartered in San Francisco. We offer competitive compensation and benefits, optional equity donation matching, generous vacation and parental leave, flexible working hours, and a lovely office space in which to collaborate with colleagues. &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Guidance on Candidates&#39; AI Usage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learn about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;our policy&lt;/a&gt; for using AI in our application process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Zscaler (NASDAQ: ZS) accelerates digital transformation so customers can be more agile, efficient, resilient, and secure. The Zscaler Zero Trust Exchange™️ platform protects thousands of customers from cyberattacks and data loss by securely connecting users, devices, and applications in any location. Distributed across 160+ public exchanges globally and thousands of private exchanges at the edge, the SASE-based Zero Trust Exchange is the world’s largest in-line cloud security platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the future of work is Human + AI and are building an AI-native enterprise where human potential is amplified by machine intelligence to solve the world’s hardest security challenges. Driven by deep customer obsession, we are committed to the mission, outcome, and to each other. We bring these commitments to life through three core behaviors: ownership and collaboration, trust through outcomes and impact, and a challenge culture with ongoing feedback. Ready to make an impact at the company pioneering security transformation in the AI era? Join us at Zscaler.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Account Executive, Commercial, UK to join our team. This is a Hybrid role, reporting to the Sales Director in the Commercial sales department. You will join a global group of professionals passionate about cloud security leadership and driving a secure, cloud-enabled digital future. In this role, you will demonstrate the power and agility of Zscaler cloud transformation by managing a territory focused on net new logos and up-sell opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of an assigned territory focused on net new logo and up-sell opportunities within accounts of 750 to 5,000 employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate expertise in building business cases that clearly show value and differentiation at all levels of customer and prospect organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner effectively with Sales Engineering, Solution Architecture, Value Consulting, and Transformation teams throughout your sales cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive consistent pipeline generation using modern techniques, joint field marketing initiatives, and top-tier channel partners including VARs, SIs, and SPs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute a disciplined sales process from beginning to end while maintaining a high level of accountability for your territory&#39;s growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in ambiguity. You&#39;re comfortable building the path as you walk it. You thrive in a dynamic environment, seeing ambiguity not as a hindrance, but as the raw material to build something meaningful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You act like an owner. Your passion for the mission fuels your bias for action. You operate with integrity because you genuinely care about the outcome. True ownership involves leveraging dynamic range: the ability to navigate seamlessly between high-level strategy and hands-on execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a problem-solver. You love running towards the challenges because you are laser-focused on finding the solution, knowing that solving the hard problems delivers the biggest impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a high-trust collaborator. You are ambitious for the team, not just yourself. You embrace our challenge culture by giving and receiving ongoing feedback—knowing that candor delivered with clarity and respect is the truest form of teamwork and the fastest way to earn trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a learner. You have a true growth mindset and are obsessed with your own development, actively seeking feedback to become a better partner and a stronger teammate. You love what you do and you do it with purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foundational understanding of AI/ML technologies and experience leveraging, securing, or positioning AI-driven solutions to optimize outcomes within your functional domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 3 years of sales experience with a revenue quota, specifically selling to commercial accounts in the UK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;History of a consistent track record of over-achievement in net new logo accomplishments and a strong understanding of how to leverage channel partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated willingness to be coached and the discipline to follow a proven sales process from start to finish&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead &#39;team sales&#39; by effectively utilizing internal resources, partners, and team members to achieve success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leveraging AI-powered sales intelligence tools, conversational AI, or predictive pipeline analytics to accelerate commercial deal velocity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience selling security, SaaS, or enterprise software solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business or a related field of study&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-FO1 #LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;At Zscaler, we are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve and the customers we work with. We foster an inclusive environment that values all backgrounds and perspectives, emphasizing collaboration and belonging. Join us in our mission to make doing business seamless and secure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Benefits program is one of the most important ways we support our employees. Zscaler proudly offers comprehensive and inclusive benefits to meet the diverse needs of our employees and their families throughout their life stages, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off plans for vacation and sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-office perks, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Learn more about Zscaler&#39;s hybrid working model and benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zscaler.com/candidate-resource-hub&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this role, you adhere to applicable laws, regulations, and Zscaler policies, including those related to security and privacy standards and guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing equal employment opportunities to all individuals. We strive to create a workplace where employees are treated with respect and have the chance to succeed. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy or related medical conditions), age, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, genetic information, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. &lt;em&gt;See more information by clicking on the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Know Your Rights: Workplace Discrimination is Illegal &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;link.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pay Transparency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler complies with all applicable federal, state, and local pay transparency rules.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing reasonable support (called accommodations or adjustments) in our recruiting processes for candidates who are differently abled, have long term conditions, mental health conditions or sincerely held religious beliefs, or who are neurodivergent or require pregnancy-related support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who are we?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zeta Global is seeking a talented and versatile Data Engineer to join our Data Exchange team within our highly skilled development office in Copenhagen. This team plays a critical role in developing and deploying Zeta’s next-generation data science and engineering technology, collaborating closely with our global teams in the US, Europe, India and Philippines. The Copenhagen office boasts a dynamic and focused environment, comprising a core group of start-up veterans and approximately 30 highly skilled professionals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a member of the Data Exchange team, you will contribute to the analysis, development, and maintenance of our complex data infrastructure, a sophisticated ecosystem of interconnected systems. This team tackles a continuous stream of challenging projects originating from across the organization, demanding a high degree of expertise and innovation. We are seeking candidates with a strong foundation in data engineering, data analysis, and software development principles, and a demonstrated interest in exploring the intersections between these disciplines.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Company&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zeta Global is a data and AI-powered marketing technology company built on the foundation of a robust consumer data platform. With billions of proprietary data points and sophisticated machine learning algorithms, Zeta helps marketers unlock actionable insights into consumer behavior and preferences. The company&#39;s Zeta Marketing Platform harnesses this powerful combination of data and AI to create personalized customer experiences across the entire customer journey, ultimately driving significant growth for its clients. Through a commitment to innovation in data science, Zeta Global provides enterprises with the tools they need to build meaningful and profitable customer relationships.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate for the Data Engineer position at Zeta Global Copenhagen is a highly motivated and analytical individual with a passion for understanding complex (software) systems. You are adept at using data to identify issues, formulate solutions, and develop robust data pipelines and software. You thrive in an environment that offers significant autonomy in planning and executing your work, yet you are also a strong collaborator, readily engaging with fellow developers and international product stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be involved in every stage of the development process, from initial brainstorming to ongoing maintenance, with a primary emphasis on analysis, prototyping, and development. Our development process is a dynamic blend of agile and rapid prototyping methodologies, designed to foster a culture of &quot;flexibility under responsibility.&quot; We prioritize focused development time and believe in the power of collaborative problem-solving, encouraging team members to both seek and offer assistance readily.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your profile&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome candidates with a solid background in data analysis or software development, seeking professionals with proven experience or recent graduates. Regardless of your background, a crucial element is your intellectual curiosity, self-motivation, and a demonstrable ability to translate real-world challenges into data models, ETL processes, algorithms, and ultimately, functional code. A strong interest in data engineering and/or the AdTech domain, along with its associated technologies, is highly desirable, as well as knowledge of object-oriented programming languages, particularly Scala.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A strong academic background in a quantitative field (Computer Science, Mathematics, Physics, or related disciplines).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience in designing, building, and maintaining scalable and reliable data pipelines.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proficiency in Python, Scala or other OOP languages for data engineering and processing tasks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong data analysis skills, including working with large datasets.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of&amp;nbsp;distributed data processing&amp;nbsp;for batch workloads.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Solid understanding of database technologies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2-3 years of experience with Scala for data processing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong software engineering skills, including experience with CI/CD pipelines and best coding practices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with data integrations and efficient data transfers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of data modeling, data warehousing concepts, and query optimization techniques.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with distributed data processing using Apache Spark.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with Airflow for workflow orchestration, scheduling, and monitoring data pipelines.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cloud expertise, particularly AWS, including services such as S3, Glue, Athena and EMR.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You approach problems with an analytical mindset and a pragmatic approach to solution development. You are a creative thinker, capable of identifying opportunities and weaknesses in proposed solutions, and constructively contributing with your own ideas. You thrive in a dynamic environment, adept at juggling multiple projects and connecting them with underlying data. You recognize that exploring new facets of data often yields greater insights than fine-tuning algorithmic parameters. You are equally comfortable implementing and optimizing solutions, and you are eager to tackle new challenges.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a proactive and independent worker, eager to understand and engage with the company&#39;s core problem space. You possess excellent English communication skills, enabling effective collaboration with management and colleagues across our international offices. You are adaptable and comfortable navigating a dynamic environment where priorities may shift, taking ownership of tasks and seeing them through to completion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our dynamic team, largely comprised of Masters and PhDs in fields like Physics, Math, and Computer Science, and play a key role in shaping the future of our technology. You will collaborate with highly skilled professionals in a stimulating environment that fosters both learning and individual initiative. While we are passionate about exploring cutting-edge technologies and algorithms, we maintain a practical approach to implementing solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in empowering our employees with autonomy and flexibility. We offer flexible work arrangements, including adjustable office hours and the possibility of occasional remote work, provided commitments are consistently fulfilled. You will have the freedom to select your preferred operating system (Mac, Windows) and development tools, with the expectation of independent maintenance and troubleshooting. We encourage the introduction of new technologies, contingent upon demonstrating their value and gaining team buy-in.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our international presence provides ample opportunities for cross-departmental collaboration and potential career advancement in locations like Berlin, San Francisco or New York.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Interested candidates are encouraged to apply via LinkedIn, submitting a cover letter along with their application. Interviews will be scheduled on a continuous basis.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Hudl, we build great teams. We hire the best of the best to ensure you’re working with people you can constantly learn from. You’re trusted to get your work done your way while testing the limits of what’s possible and what’s next. We work hard to provide a culture where everyone feels supported, and our employees feel it—their votes helped us become one of &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/blog/newsweek-top-100-global-most-loved-workplaces-2023&quot;&gt;Newsweek&#39;s Top 100 Global Most Loved Workplaces&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We think of ourselves as the team behind the team, supporting the lifelong impact sports can have: the lessons in teamwork and dedication; the influence of inspiring coaches; and the opportunities to reach new heights. That’s why we help teams from all over the world see their game differently. Our products make it easier for coaches and athletes at any level to capture video, analyze data, share highlights and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to join us?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;padding: 56.25% 0 0 0; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe style=&quot;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://player.vimeo.com/video/1095624224?h=9e8cdc9dbe&amp;amp;badge=0&amp;amp;autopause=0&amp;amp;player_id=0&amp;amp;app_id=58479&quot; width=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Your Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring an &lt;strong&gt;Engineer II&lt;/strong&gt; to join one of our cross-functional product teams in our Athlete Performance group, which is focused on building cutting-edge solutions for athletes and sports teams that directly impact how they train, compete and achieve peak performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll focus on building high-performance mobile applications and core data services across iOS and Android. You will help build and maintain hardware-agnostic communication interfaces to stream live sensor and optical tracking data to the cloud and mobile clients. You&#39;ll work on translating complex physical and biomechanical data into clear, digestible metrics that support real-time decision-making for elite coaches, athletes, and medical teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this position, you&#39;ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work with a cross-functional team.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll collaborate with Engineering, Quality Assurance, Product, Design and Scrum disciplines to deliver feature-rich mobile and the back-end services that power them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop and deliver.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll take ownership of specific features, defining low-latency communication interfaces across the stack and building user-facing application features that turn complex sensor data into clear, actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test new ideas.&lt;/strong&gt; At Hudl, we iterate rapidly, deploying changes to the product hundreds of times daily across our Engineering team. You&#39;ll write high-quality code, conduct code reviews, and help solve well-defined technical problems using modern mobile and cloud development best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow your skills.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll collaborate with senior engineers and tech leads to refine your technical architecture skills, learning to navigate trade-offs in system performance, real-time data streaming, and application responsiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Time spent collaborating with your teammates in-office will be a regular part of how you work. We&#39;re currently considering applicants within commuting distance of London. You&#39;ll be expected to work more days in-office than remote, but will have the freedom to coordinate your specific in-office schedule with your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Must-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mobile experience.&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience developing native or cross-platform mobile applications, ideally with React Native (iOS and Android).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems mindset.&lt;/strong&gt; You have experience working with different API styles, communication patterns for streaming data across mobile clients and back-end systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A team player.&lt;/strong&gt; You understand that problem-solving is a team effort and enjoy collaborating with peers to learn, share knowledge, and build great software together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;User-focused.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re excited to build intuitive interfaces that translate complex physical or optical sensor data into digestible information for real-world users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Willingness to learn.&lt;/strong&gt; You have solid core engineering skills and are excited to dive into mobile frameworks, time-series data streams, or cloud architecture as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice-to-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Backend &amp;amp; Cloud Architecture knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience with modern cloud infrastructure (AWS/GCP), microservice architectures, time-series databases, and CI/CD deployment pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Data Streaming experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Background working with real-time video, wearable devices, or streaming optical/sensor data, ideally within sports technology or performance analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mobile CI/CD.&lt;/strong&gt;Experience with mobile build and release pipelines (GitHub Actions), distribution platforms (TestFlight, Firebase App Distribution), and testing frameworks such as Jest and Detox.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion work-life harmony&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We’ll give you the flexibility you need in your work life (e.g., flexible vacation time above any required statutory leave, company-wide holidays and timeout (meeting-free) days, remote work options and more) so you can enjoy your personal life too.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guarantee autonomy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We have an open, honest culture and we trust our people from day one. Your team will support you, but you’ll own your work and have the agency to try new ideas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Encourage career growth. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re lifelong learners who encourage professional development. We’ll give you tons of resources and opportunities to keep growing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide an environment to help you succeed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We&#39;ve invested in our offices, designing incredible spaces with our employees in mind. But whether you’re at the office or working remotely, we’ll provide you the tech you need to do your best work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support your wellbeing. &lt;/strong&gt;Depending on location, we offer medical and retirement benefits for employees—but no matter where you’re located, we have resources like our Employee Assistance Program and employee resource groups to support your mental health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is displayed below—&lt;strong&gt;starting salaries will typically fall near the middle of this range.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make compensation decisions based on an individual&#39;s experience, skills and education in line with our internal pay equity practices.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£51,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£86,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion at Hudl&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hudl is an equal opportunity employer. Through our actions, behaviors and attitude, we’ll create an environment where everyone, no matter their differences, feels like they belong.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer resources to ensure our employees feel safe bringing their authentic selves to work, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/about-inclusion&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;including employee resource groups and communities&lt;/a&gt;. But we recognize there’s ongoing work to be done, which is why we track our efforts and commitments in &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/about-inclusion&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;annual inclusion reports&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We also know imposter syndrome is real and the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theatlantic.com/magazine/archive/2014/05/the-confidence-gap/359815/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;confidence gap&lt;/a&gt; can get in the way of meeting spectacular candidates. Please don’t hesitate to apply—we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/jobs/hudl-applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hudl Applicant and Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Hudl, we build great teams. We hire the best of the best to ensure you’re working with people you can constantly learn from. You’re trusted to get your work done your way while testing the limits of what’s possible and what’s next. We work hard to provide a culture where everyone feels supported, and our employees feel it—their votes helped us become one of &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/blog/newsweek-top-100-global-most-loved-workplaces-2023&quot;&gt;Newsweek&#39;s Top 100 Global Most Loved Workplaces&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We think of ourselves as the team behind the team, supporting the lifelong impact sports can have: the lessons in teamwork and dedication; the influence of inspiring coaches; and the opportunities to reach new heights. That’s why we help teams from all over the world see their game differently. Our products make it easier for coaches and athletes at any level to capture video, analyze data, share highlights and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to join us?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;padding: 56.25% 0 0 0; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe style=&quot;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://player.vimeo.com/video/1095624224?h=9e8cdc9dbe&amp;amp;badge=0&amp;amp;autopause=0&amp;amp;player_id=0&amp;amp;app_id=58479&quot; width=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring a Senior Manager, HR Operations to lead our HR Operations function across Europe, Asia and LATAM. In this role, you’ll translate global HR strategy into scalable programs, policies and service delivery standards while serving as a trusted advisor on complex governance and risk management across multiple international regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Manager, HR Operations, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive strategy and advisory.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll shape the roadmap for international HR operations, aligning global policy with local needs while acting as a trusted advisor to senior leaders across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead governance and compliance.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll manage end-to-end compliance across employment contracts, the employee lifecycle, global mobility, benefits, payroll and health and safety protocols across multiple countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize processes.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll leverage automation and AI to scale operational efficiency, manage vendor relationships and execute key initiatives like policy overhauls or M&amp;amp;A integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop team talent.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll directly manage our HR Operations Manager and coach the broader regional team, setting service-level standards and using metrics to showcase operational impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Location&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Time spent collaborating with your teammates in-office will be a regular part of how you work. We’re currently considering applicants within commuting distance of London or Barcelona. You’ll be expected to work more days in-office than remote, but will have the freedom to coordinate your specific in-office schedule with your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Must-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experienced manager.&lt;/strong&gt; You bring 10+ years of HR operations experience, including at least five years managing teams in a global environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International compliance expertise.&lt;/strong&gt; You have deep working knowledge of employment law, payroll, benefits and compliance across multiple countries, with strong experience in European regions like the U.K., Spain, Italy and the Netherlands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI fluent.&lt;/strong&gt; You have proven experience leveraging AI tools to optimize operations and improve workflow efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process builder.&lt;/strong&gt; You excel at creating scalable, automated processes across complex regulatory landscapes while balancing hands-on execution with long-term strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional collaborator.&lt;/strong&gt; You build strong partnerships with Legal, Finance and IT, comfortably managing vendor negotiations and influencing senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice-to-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multilingual.&lt;/strong&gt; Conversational or fluent Spanish skills are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Certified professional.&lt;/strong&gt; SHRM-SCP, GPHR or equivalent certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced degree.&lt;/strong&gt; Master&#39;s degree in HR, Business or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion work-life harmony&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We’ll give you the flexibility you need in your work life (e.g., flexible vacation time above any required statutory leave, company-wide holidays and timeout (meeting-free) days, remote work options and more) so you can enjoy your personal life too.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guarantee autonomy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We have an open, honest culture and we trust our people from day one. Your team will support you, but you’ll own your work and have the agency to try new ideas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Encourage career growth. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re lifelong learners who encourage professional development. We’ll give you tons of resources and opportunities to keep growing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide an environment to help you succeed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We&#39;ve invested in our offices, designing incredible spaces with our employees in mind. But whether you’re at the office or working remotely, we’ll provide you the tech you need to do your best work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support your wellbeing. &lt;/strong&gt;Depending on location, we offer medical and retirement benefits for employees—but no matter where you’re located, we have resources like our Employee Assistance Program and employee resource groups to support your mental health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is displayed below—&lt;strong&gt;starting salaries will typically fall near the middle of this range.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make compensation decisions based on an individual&#39;s experience, skills and education in line with our internal pay equity practices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will also be eligible for a long-term incentive (LTI) award. Any bonuses awarded are based on individual and company performance paid at Hudl&#39;s discretion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£75,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£125,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion at Hudl&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hudl is an equal opportunity employer. Through our actions, behaviors and attitude, we’ll create an environment where everyone, no matter their differences, feels like they belong.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer resources to ensure our employees feel safe bringing their authentic selves to work, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/about-inclusion&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;including employee resource groups and communities&lt;/a&gt;. But we recognize there’s ongoing work to be done, which is why we track our efforts and commitments in &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/about-inclusion&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;annual inclusion reports&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We also know imposter syndrome is real and the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theatlantic.com/magazine/archive/2014/05/the-confidence-gap/359815/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;confidence gap&lt;/a&gt; can get in the way of meeting spectacular candidates. Please don’t hesitate to apply—we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/jobs/hudl-applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hudl Applicant and Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;The Role&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Software Engineer with a &lt;strong&gt;minimum of 15 years of experience&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll work on our in-house package, &#39;Miles,&#39; an ERP software for automotive finance, leasing, fleet, and mobility management. This end-to-end solution encompasses front, mid, and back-office functions that can be extensively customized to the customers’ needs through configuration and custom development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be part of a multidisciplinary team that includes other developers, business consultants, and testers, covering our end-to-end business flow. You can rely on a broad base of knowledge and expertise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every team in Sofico works in an agile way, including scrum, daily stand-ups, and backlog refinement. Additionally, you’ll be joining our Java community, which connects all the Software Engineers within Sofico worldwide to share best practices, code, tips, and tricks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;The Right Fit for the Role&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A passion for developing and building solutions is at the top of our list. As a Software Engineer, it is also key to keep the bigger picture in mind and understand how different elements are intertwined. Problem-solving is one of your strongest abilities, and you approach it methodically. If you are a team player who &lt;strong&gt;enjoys collaborating &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;sharing knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;, you’re the perfect blend of technical and soft skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position, based in &lt;strong&gt;Sydney&lt;/strong&gt;, offers a hybrid work model: three days in-office and two days remote.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Candidates must possess full working rights in Australia; sponsorship is not available.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your application, elaborate on the following aspects of your career:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience spanning over &lt;strong&gt;15 years&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise as either a Full Stack Developer or specialized in Back End development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;Java 17, Java EE 7, SQL/JPA, Hibernate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;Agile&lt;/strong&gt; Methodology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong&gt;Automotive, Finance, or Leasing&lt;/strong&gt; industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in &lt;strong&gt;Monolithic &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;Microservices&lt;/strong&gt; architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significance in constructing and deploying solutions, both internally and for clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engagement in enhancing current applications, developing new modules, or executing customization projects for clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstration of adeptly &lt;strong&gt;resolving complex problems&lt;/strong&gt; in a systematic manner, with project-specific details provided in your application&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills, including client interaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English, given our international and multicultural environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;About Us&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discover how Sofico empowers businesses in 27 countries worldwide. With offices in Australia, Belgium, France, Germany, Japan, Mexico, the Netherlands, and the UK, our Sydney-based hub manages clients across Australia and Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our flagship product, Miles, has completed over 60 successful implementations and earned a solid reputation in automotive finance, leasing, fleet, and mobility management. It&#39;s an ERP system renowned for its unmatched flexibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sofico operates at the intersection of rapidly transforming industries: automotive, finance, leasing, and IT. This convergence sparks innovation as our clients pioneer new product offerings, focusing on mobility solutions enabled by connected cars.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us—a multinational company with over 600 staff—as we lead the way in industry innovation. Unlock new possibilities with Sofico.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What We Offer&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Sofico, we welcome you to an international and multicultural company that has been thriving for over 30 years and is doubling in size every five years. Growth is in our DNA, and we strongly uphold our horizontal and open company culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take control of your career with a focus on personal development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in an extensive six-month onboarding program, supported by a dedicated job coach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy continuous opportunities for learning and professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a modern, state-of-the-art office that&#39;s easily accessible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Onsite parking and walking distance from metro.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from a competitive salary, flexible office hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid option to work from home two days a week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access novated leasing options and mobile phone reimbursement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy complimentary coffee, soft drinks, breakfast and fruit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in team events, including afterwork drinks, BBQs, family days, and company weekends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re ready to join a dynamic team and take your career to the next level, apply today!&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Category Manager Packaging &amp;amp; Sustainability, you will report to the Senior International Category Manager for Packaging. You will collaborate on developing and leading the category strategy, drive process improvement initiatives across Australia and New Zealand, and act as a point of escalation for operational matters. We are looking for an ambitious, confident, entrepreneurial, and high-spirited Sustainability &amp;amp; Procurement professional with a strength for data processing, optimization, and reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in Chippendale, Sydney and reporting to the Senior International Category Manager for Packaging.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, optimize, and align the packaging supplier network and Category Strategy across Australia and New Zealand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create ongoing data analysis and category reviews to drive strategic performance and achieve ambitious targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support in providing procurement advice, price updates, reporting, invoice approval, replenishment, compliance, and tenders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with suppliers to build strong long-term relationships and execute contracts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project manage and coordinate the preparation of all Non-Financial Reporting and monthly GHG scope data for the ANZ market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive local sustainability optimization projects, including energy efficiency, renewable energy transition, and packaging innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate required Scope 3 carbon reduction initiatives and act as the local point of contact for all regional sustainability work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of strategic procurement, sustainability, supply chain, or commercial consulting experience (ideally in food/FMCG).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Business, Supply Chain, Sustainability, Economics, or Procurement (or equivalent).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound understanding of Sustainability drivers locally including APCO, and conceptual understanding of ‘How to” impact sustainability, primarily focussed on Packaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the packaging arena, including material specifications, supplier markets, and running regional tenders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quantitative and analytical expertise, with a solid comfort level using Excel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, flexible, and assertive, with a strong ability to take ownership of your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized and able to prioritize your workload effectively in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial, driven by a sense of urgency, and capable of making things happen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with travel requirements of up to 10% of your time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to have a significant impact in a leading global food technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working arrangements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Egoless environment, constant learning with room for personal growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free access to Headspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal learning &amp;amp; development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A diverse and vibrant international environment, with offices in 18 countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company discount - 70% off HelloFresh &amp;amp; 40% off Youfoodz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start Date: &lt;/strong&gt;Immediately available - Can wait a notice period&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration: &lt;/strong&gt;Permanent full time role&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Chippendale Head Office - hybrid working environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary: &lt;/strong&gt;Competitive salary &amp;amp; employee benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;This is an exciting entry point into strategic procurement at the HelloFresh Group! As a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;89&quot;&gt;Category Management Graduate for European Herbs&lt;/strong&gt;, you will get hands-on experience in a live, high-impact category — supporting a portfolio of approximately £10m in annual spend across 6 European markets — with the close guidance and mentorship of an experienced team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;In this role, you will learn the full category management cycle for Herbs: supporting supplier relationships, assisting with tender processes, tracking cost and quality performance, and coordinating cross-functionally with Supply Chain, FSQA, and Product teams. Alongside day-to-day operational support, you will contribute to key strategic initiatives, including the rollout of our new cross-dock supply model in Europe and project support across Fruit Bags, Avocados, and Sustainability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;We are looking for someone analytically sharp, commercially curious, and eager to learn fast. You don’t need years of procurement experience — just the drive to learn, strong attention to detail, and a passion for fresh produce and supply chains!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Category Management Support&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot;&gt;Assist with day-to-day procurement activities for the European Herbs category, including monitoring order status, tracking shortage responses, and assisting with quality coordination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1,0&quot;&gt;Support the execution of the Herbs category strategy, gathering market data and helping track supplier performance and supply risks across 6 markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2,0&quot;&gt;Support tender processes for the category — assisting with data preparation, supplier briefings, and preliminary commercial analysis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11,3,0&quot;&gt;Help maintain accurate cost reporting, invoice tracking, and administrative supplier data for the Herbs category.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supplier Collaboration&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot;&gt;Act as a secondary point of contact for Herbs suppliers across Europe, helping manage routine operational queries and administrative follow-ups.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot;&gt;Assist the Teamlead in preparing materials for supplier meetings, joint business planning sessions, and contract discussions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot;&gt;Track and report on supplier performance metrics (OTIF, quality, and sustainability KPIs), escalating potential risks proactively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Cross-Functional &amp;amp; Strategic Projects&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0&quot;&gt;Support the cross-dock supply chain pilot in Europe by helping coordinate communication between Procurement, Supply Chain Operations, and suppliers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0&quot;&gt;Provide analytical and coordination support across strategic initiatives in Fruit Bags, Avocados, and Fruit &amp;amp; Sustainability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0&quot;&gt;Collaborate with internal teams (Product, FSQA, Operations) to ensure procurement documentation and alignment remain smooth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,3,0&quot;&gt;Research and monitor market dynamics in herbs and fresh produce — such as seasonality, weather risks, and pricing trends — bringing valuable insights to team discussions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Education &amp;amp; Background&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;19&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;19,0,0&quot;&gt;Recently graduated from a Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s program in Business, Supply Chain, Finance, Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;19,1,0&quot;&gt;Previous internship, placement, or academic project experience in an analytical or commercial environment is a plus (direct procurement experience is not required).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;19,2,0&quot;&gt;A genuine interest in food, agriculture, or global supply chains — curiosity about where ingredients come from will serve you well here!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Mindset&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;21&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;21,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;21,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Analytically Minded:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable working with data in Excel/Google Sheets, analyzing costs, and presenting findings clearly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;21,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;21,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Organized &amp;amp; Proactive:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong attention to detail, ability to manage multiple small tasks, and eagerness to take initiative.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;21,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;21,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Commercially Curious:&lt;/strong&gt; Eager to understand how pricing works, why supply chains move, and how strategic decisions impact business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;21,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;21,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Adaptable &amp;amp; Collaborative:&lt;/strong&gt; Thrives in a fast-paced, international team environment and eager to learn on the go.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;21,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;21,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent written and spoken English is required; fluency in a second European language (French, German, Dutch, Spanish, or Italian) is a strong advantage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;21,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;21,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; Willingness to travel internationally up to 25% of the time if required for project support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will make HelloFresh better. There are many different ways of developing skills, and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you. We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;70% off HelloFresh or Green Chef boxes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gym membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bupa private medical insurance (including dental &amp;amp; family cover options)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health first aiders and an employee assistance programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dog friendly office! (London site only)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nursery support scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Group Life Assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Next steps: Your application will be reviewed and if successful, a member of the Talent Acquisition Team will be in touch within 2 weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note that we will be unable to offer visa sponsorship for this position.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are required to cooperate with HelloFresh in all health and safety matters. You are responsible for ensuring you take reasonable care of your own health, and safety as well as others who may be affected by the work activities you undertake. You must report incidents immediately and actively raise health and safety-related concerns to your Line Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are currently a HelloFresh employee, please make sure you have discussed your application with your Line Manager.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Eucalyptus&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re on a mission to make good health last a lifetime. More than 1 billion people live with obesity worldwide, driving preventable chronic conditions. We&#39;re here to build better long-term care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eucalyptus is now part of Hims &amp;amp; Hers, the global leader in personalised health and wellness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is the company behind Juniper, one of the world&#39;s largest weight-management programs combining GLP-1 medication with personalised nutrition, movement support, and clinician-led care from prescribers, nurses, health coaches, pharmacists, and dietitians. Our published clinical research shows that our combined clinical and behavioural approach helps patients lose significantly more weight during their treatment with Juniper by four times.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our Growth Story:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting patients living with obesity across our 5 markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Received selective NICE endorsement to provide services to the NHS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tailored our offering to thousands of patients in Australia, the UK, Germany, Japan and Canada.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Hims &amp;amp; Hers grows internationally, the complexity of our business, organisation and leadership needs is growing with it. We’re looking for a Director of People Partnering, EMEA to help build the leadership and talent, and strengthen the organisation, for what comes next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll work with senior leaders on the critical people and organisational decisions needed to drive the next phase of our international growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll start with the business problem, bring an independent point of view, and help leaders translate business strategy into the organisation, leadership and talent decisions required to support growth and performance. You’ll shape strategy with senior leaders while staying close enough to the business to turn decisions into action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leading and developing a high-performing People Partnering team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach and develop a team of People Partners and People Advisers, building the capability and judgment needed to support an increasingly complex business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the standard for what excellent People Partnering looks like, building a team that is commercially sharp, exercises strong judgment and is trusted by the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create clarity around roles, priorities and ownership across the team, focusing support where it can have the greatest impact as the business grows and evolves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring senior-level judgment to complex and sensitive people matters within the team’s client groups, working with Employment Legal and local experts where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving business strategy through people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with senior leaders to understand their priorities and determine what they mean for the organisation, leadership and talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a deep understanding of the business — what drives growth, where the organisation is getting in its own way, and where changes to structure, talent or leadership will have the greatest impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead organisational design and workforce planning, helping leaders make clear, data-informed decisions about structure, roles, capabilities, spans and layers as the business grows and evolves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring regional business and talent needs into the global People agenda, while helping translate global priorities into approaches that work effectively across local markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthening leadership and talent&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach senior leaders to strengthen their effectiveness and that of their leadership teams, bringing an independent point of view when it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build leadership capability by helping leaders set a high bar, give clear feedback, manage performance, make strong talent decisions and build increasingly effective teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the bar on talent — identifying and developing critical talent, addressing performance gaps, strengthening succession, and ensuring we have the leadership and capabilities the business needs as it grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help senior leaders navigate periods of significant change, bringing clarity to complex organisational and talent decisions and anticipating the downstream impact on teams, leaders and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shaping the People Partnering agenda&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the direction and priorities for People Partnering across the region, focusing the team on the highest-impact business, organisation and talent needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use people data, business context and what you’re hearing across the organisation to identify patterns, anticipate risks, surface opportunities leaders may not yet see, and turn those insights into action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across the broader People team to solve business problems end to end, bringing together the right expertise across People Partnering, Talent Acquisition, Total Rewards and People Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make thoughtful tradeoffs about where the People Partnering team focuses, balancing immediate business needs with longer-term organisation and talent priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience operating as a senior People Partner or HRBP in complex, high-growth environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of working directly with senior executives and influencing important decisions about organisation, leadership, workforce and talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success leading organisation design, workforce planning, leadership development, talent strategy and meaningful organisational change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen with the ability to quickly understand business priorities and translate complex challenges into practical organisation and talent solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The credibility and confidence to bring an independent point of view, challenge assumptions and influence senior leaders when it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and developing People Partnering or HR advisory teams, setting a high bar and building strong, independent partners to the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of UK employment law and experience operating across multiple jurisdictions, with the judgment to navigate complex employee matters and know when to engage Employment Legal or local expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated ability to anticipate organisational issues, connect patterns across the business and proactively solve problems before they slow the organisation down.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A builder’s mindset, with a track record of creating scalable approaches that improve how organisations operate as they grow and evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to move seamlessly between long-term strategy and hands-on execution — comfortable going deep when the situation requires it and moving quickly when it doesn’t.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join Eucalyptus?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is also behind a growing family of digital healthcare clinics (&lt;a href=&quot;https://pilot.com.au/&quot;&gt;Pilot,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.kinfertility.com.au/&quot;&gt;Kin&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://skin.software/&quot;&gt;Software&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.compound.co/&quot;&gt;Compound&lt;/a&gt;) across men’s health and well-being, fertility, skincare, and preventative health.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s what makes joining Euc unique:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s next&lt;/strong&gt; - Our goal for the next three years is to support &lt;strong&gt;1 million patients globally&lt;/strong&gt; to live better for longer. We’re launching into new conditions, demographics, and geographies as we build a truly preventive healthcare ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build something world-changing&lt;/strong&gt; - We’re on the path to becoming the world’s largest international digital healthcare company. It will be challenging, fast-paced, and deeply rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make real impact&lt;/strong&gt; - You will deliver work that directly shapes patient outcomes and scales evidence-based care across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerate your growth&lt;/strong&gt; - You will have high ownership, continuous feedback, and dedicated development support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join a motivated team&lt;/strong&gt; - You will collaborate with talented peers to solve complex clinical and operational problems at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What’s ahead in the UK&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Invest in your growth&lt;/strong&gt; – Annual development budget plus 3 days of professional development leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work flexibly&lt;/strong&gt; – Hybrid setup with 3 days a week in our Old Street office, designed for focus and collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support your well-being&lt;/strong&gt; – Private health insurance through Vitality or opt for a monthly wellness allowance to spend on what matters most to you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take time off&lt;/strong&gt; – 25 days of holiday, enhanced parental leave and work from anywhere 3 weeks out of the year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join a connected team&lt;/strong&gt; – A vibrant office culture with regular socials, clubs, after-school sport, and seasonal events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Eucalyptus, we value individuals from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives, and we embrace the unique qualities each person brings. When you apply, please let us know of any reasonable adjustments you may need during the interview process. We use AI-assisted tools across our business to help our teams work more efficiently, including within our recruitment process. These tools support our team — all hiring decisions are made by real people, and every application is reviewed by a member of our recruitment team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;At Dexory, we&#39;re developing advanced software powered by cutting-edge robots that are transforming the very face of global logistics. With infectious enthusiasm, our unique blend of disciplines work in harmony to produce results at pace. From hardware and manufacturing to software, AI and commercial, we&#39;re one team – one heart – that beats, learns and grows together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take your customer analysis out of the dashboard and onto the warehouse floor.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Senior Customer Analyst &lt;/strong&gt;you already know how to find the story in customer data: segments, drivers of churn, usage patterns, voice-of-customer signals. Here, you&#39;ll pair that with what you see first-hand in live warehouses, then use both to decide which product bets Dexory makes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get to the &quot;why&quot; behind the numbers.&lt;/strong&gt; Run contextual inquiry, operator and manager interviews, surveys, card sorts, and prototype and usability tests across every stage of deployment and every persona.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check site behaviour against behaviour at scale.&lt;/strong&gt; Combine what you observe on site with Pendo and DexoryView usage data, so no insight rests on one warehouse or one dashboard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Validate or kill ideas quickly.&lt;/strong&gt; Pressure-test concepts with A/B tests, prototype tests and interviews, and tell the team whether a bet solves a real problem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Close the loop after go-live.&lt;/strong&gt; Log structured operator and site-manager feedback, pass it to the PM, and keep it in the research repository.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Size the opportunity.&lt;/strong&gt; Support market sizing and competitive mapping for specific themes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn findings into decisions.&lt;/strong&gt; Write clear, presentation-ready syntheses and share them through Notion and Slack, internally and externally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run the insight machinery.&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain SurveyMonkey dashboards, co-maintain the research insights pipeline, and feed capacity and progress data into the shared operating dashboard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape how we work with AI.&lt;/strong&gt; Co-design the AI enablement playbook for research, covering workflows, prompts, guardrails, and what stays human-only versus human-in-the-loop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Give the user a voice.&lt;/strong&gt; Co-develop UX content with the Lead and Commercial team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-4 years in research, qual/quant insight, or product/bet design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid grounding in qualitative and quantitative methods, and the judgement to know which one a question needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity, from open question through to early product bet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with tools like Notion, SurveyMonkey, Slack, Pendo and Basecamp&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal synthesis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Field experience in warehouses, logistics, manufacturing, healthcare operations or similar, and comfort on a warehouse floor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UX content skills, including capturing the voice of the user&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;*We value the right attitude, humility and we&#39;re as interested in your character as we are in your talent. Please apply, even if you feel you only meet part of our listed criteria. Diversity drives innovation and we offer an international and friendly work environment with an energetic company culture.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Starting from the interview process and continuing into your career with us, you will be working by our four Operating Principles:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance:&lt;/strong&gt; High standards, outstanding results,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Big challenges, bigger results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commitment:&lt;/strong&gt; All in, every time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;One team:&lt;/strong&gt; One mission, shared success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining Dexory isn’t just about having expertise… it’s about embracing uncertainty with purpose. You’ll&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;help define not only our products, but the future of autonomous logistics itself. From day one, you’ll be&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;trusted to push boundaries, take ownership, and deliver breakthrough results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll also receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private healthcare via Bupa with 24/7 medical helpline&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Income protection&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension: 4+% employee with option to opt into salary exchange, 5% employer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Programme - mental wellbeing, financial and legal advice/support&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 holidays per year&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full meals onsite in Wallingford&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fun team events on and offsite, snacks of all kinds in the office&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AAP/EEO Statement &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dexory provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment. It prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, colour, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by local laws. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation and training&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note: We are unable to provide relocation or sponsorship for this role.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;With millions of diners, 60,000+ restaurant partners and 25+ years of experience, OpenTable, part of Booking Holdings, Inc. (NASDAQ: BKNG), is an industry leader with a passion for helping restaurants thrive. Our world-class technology empowers restaurants to focus on what matters most – their team, their guests, and their bottom line – while enabling diners to discover and book the perfect restaurant for every occasion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every employee at OpenTable has a tangible impact on what we do and how we do it. You’ll also be part of a global team and its portfolio of metasearch brands. Hospitality is all about taking care of others, and it defines our culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OpenTable, a Booking Holdings, Inc. company, is seeking a 12 month fixed-term Talent Acquisition Partner to join our global team in London. In this role, you will be instrumental in recruiting fresh talent across multiple countries and departments, including Sales and Services, Engineering, Marketing, and Finance &amp;amp; Accounting. You will have a tangible impact on our business by acting as a brand ambassador, driving the full cycle recruitment process, and passionately advocating for candidate experience and diversity and inclusion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own full cycle recruitment responsibilities, continuously sourcing, screening, evaluating, and recommending candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Attract top talent and engage passive candidates through direct sourcing, networking, online databases, social media, employee referrals, and creative programs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Accurately track progress and maintain tracking metrics for recruiting using our ATS (Greenhouse).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as a brand ambassador to build and maintain the OpenTable employment brand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build positive relationships with employees across business functions and act as a trusted advisor to hiring managers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pipeline talent for future roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5 or more years of recruiting experience in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience prioritizing and leading multiple searches simultaneously.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrable track record of acting as a trusted advisor to hiring managers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to work autonomously with a sense of urgency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Local to the London area and able to commute into the office 2 days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience recruiting for roles across the EU&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Creative and results-oriented mindset focused on building positive relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Adaptability and flexibility in the workplace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to communicate, interact, and negotiate effectively across time-zones with a variety of internal clients and external candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Environment &amp;amp; Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At OpenTable, we pride ourselves on fostering a global and dynamic work environment. As a team member with us, you will benefit from a schedule tailored to accommodate a global workforce operating across multiple time zones. While the majority of your responsibilities may align with conventional business hours, there will be instances where you are expected to manage communications - via calls, Slack messages, or emails - outside of regular working hours to effectively collaborate with international colleagues, respond to restaurant partners, and/or address urgent matters. OpenTable will always abide by and consider local laws and regulations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re committed to creating a workplace where everyone feels they belong and can thrive. We know the best ideas come when we bring different voices to the table, so we&#39;re building a team as dynamic as the diners and restaurants we serve—and fostering a culture where everyone feels welcome to be themselves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any reasonable adjustments during the application/interview process, or on the job, we’re here to support you. Please reach out to your recruiter to request any accommodations.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Type: &lt;/strong&gt;Fixed-term contract (6 months), 30 hours per week&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location:&lt;/strong&gt; On the road and at customer sites.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;£17 per hour&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Licence/Certification:&lt;/strong&gt; Full valid UK driving licence (required)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Focal Systems is the industry leader in retail AI solutions. Our mission is to automate and optimise brick-and-mortar retail using deep-learning computer vision. Focal has been deployed at scale with the top retailers in the world. We are looking for smart, creative, and passionate people who love to learn, enjoy thinking critically, share our values, and want to build a great and enduring company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have built the next-generation operating system for brick &amp;amp; mortar retail. This OS leverages shelf-mounted cameras that constantly measure the state of the retailers’ shelves and use that information to order quicker and smarter, planogram better, and schedule, direct, train, and manage their staff. We have proven this with major retailers around the world.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are currently expanding our operations throughout the UK and seeking a dedicated Field Service Technician to maintain installations for our customers in your area. This role will primarily involve working store opening hours but may include overnight work and attending installations where our product will be installed. As a crucial member of our team, you will assume accountability for the successful maintenance, deployment and adoption of our system. Physical stamina, proficiency with power tools, and the ability to meet quality and speed Key Performance Indicators (KPIs) are essential for this role.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This will be a 6 Month contract position, working a minimum of 30 hrs per week with a possibility to extend beyond the initial contract.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Possibility of weekend or night work&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Driver&#39;s License and Transportation: Valid driver&#39;s license and reliable transportation to travel to sites is required.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Onsite and offsite maintenance of camera hardware: diagnose issues, install, replace and configure in accordance with company standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct routine preventative maintenance checks to identify and address potential issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond promptly to service calls and ensure customer SLAs are met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate records of service activities, including work performed, parts used, and time spent, using company-provided tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Onboarding/scanning products into the system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As required, attend installations at various clients during night hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Installation of Focal Systems product onto shelves, ceilings, and other equipment as per installation plans and specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate power tools safely and efficiently to complete installations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adhere to safety protocols and guidelines to minimize risks during maintenance visits and installations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively with team members to ensure timely completion of installations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a high level of attention to detail to ensure maintenance tasks meet quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet or exceed speed and quality Key Performance Indicators (KPIs) consistently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate effectively with supervisors and team members to provide updates on progress and address any issues or challenges encountered during store visits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adhere to company policies and procedures at all times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven Field Service Technician Experience: Previous experience in a field technician role, preferably in field service, installation, construction, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical aptitude and troubleshooting skills, with the ability to diagnose and resolve hardware and software issues efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in using power tools and other installation equipment required for this type of role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Physical Stamina: Strong physical stamina to work on feet and perform physically demanding tasks for extended periods (up to 9 hours).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-Oriented: Excellent attention to detail to ensure maintenance work meets quality standards and adheres to specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time Management: Ability to work well under pressure, meet tight deadlines, and ensure timely completion of assigned tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication Skills: Effective communication skills to liaise with supervisors, team members, and customers, providing updates on progress and addressing any issues encountered during maintenance visits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driver&#39;s License and Transportation: Valid driver&#39;s license and reliable transportation to travel to sites as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work nights and weekends&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Focal Systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong Values and Mission - We are a tightly-knit team with an ambitious mission and a strong set of core values, which define our approach to business and have successfully guided us since inception.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exceptional Team - We are a team of hard-working, fun-loving professionals from some of the most eminent universities, research labs, and tech companies of our time. We pride ourselves on recruiting exceptional individuals to help us redefine the state-of-the-art.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Outstanding Partners - We work with 10+ of the largest retailers in the world and have a world-class roster of investors, advisors and partners to support &amp;amp; advise us in our endeavors.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We care deeply about the health, happiness, and wellbeing of all of our employees. We offer:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sick Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About THG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are THG, a global ecommerce group on a mission to be the global online leader in beauty and sports nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our portfolio of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; leading retailers and brands such as LOOKFANTASTIC, Myprotein, ESPA, Perricone MD, and Cult Beauty form our two core businesses: THG Beauty and THG Nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;From Manchester to New York, we’re powered by a team of over 2500 people who work together, lead by example, and think BIG.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;With us, you’ll go further, faster. What are you waiting for?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at THG Beauty&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We know that beauty isn’t one-size-fits-all. Our portfolio of leading retailers and iconic beauty brands caters to everyone, everywhere, empowering customers all over the world to look and feel fantastic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By combining our portfolio of owned brands inclusive of ESPA, Ameliorate and Christophe Robin,&amp;nbsp;with a marketplace for over 1,300 third-party beauty brands through online retail sites LOOKFANTASTIC, Cult Beauty, and Dermstore, THG Beauty&#39;s ambition is to be the global digital partner of choice across the beauty industry, supporting the channel shift to online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;THG Beauty’s breadth of relationships is unique to the beauty market; it engages with brands as a retailer, a brand owner, and a product developer and manufacturer, making it the industry’s digital strategic leader.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Why be a UK Ecommerce Manager at THG Beauty?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As UK Ecommerce Manager you will be responsible for building out daily trade plans and budgets, in close alignment with the Senior Ecommerce Manager. Owns phasing, reforecasting and builds out plans with Senior Channel Managers. Ensures trade plans are solid and deliver targets across all metrics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As &lt;strong&gt;UK Ecommerce Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, you’ll:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Confidence: demonstrate strong understanding of data through collection, analysis, manipulation and presentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Ability: competently use and train others on all Executive-level systems; confident use of Excel formulas and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitoring Performance: actively monitor KPI performance; proactively analyse to enhance understanding; recommend for MTG reforecast, identifying risks and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Target Setting: begin completing revenue and GP phasing for sign-off with Senior Ecommerce Manager; collaborate with marketing on KPI phasing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Campaign Management: own the campaign process end-to-end (buying, marketing, merch, retail media, creative/copy alignment); share regular progress updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily Trade Plans &amp;amp; Budgets: build and own daily trade plans and budgets in close alignment with the Senior Ecommerce Manager; own phasing and reforecasting with Senior Channel Managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Presentation: confidently create and present content to all levels of stakeholder; build storytelling skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delegation: effectively delegate workload fairly across the team to hit collective deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Development: support development of direct reports aligned to their goals, strengths and development areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning Opportunities: own onboarding and training for new starters; provide ongoing training.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relationships: strengthen and develop productive relationships across the division; establish self as a point of contact&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What skills and experience do I need for this role?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication: clear, concise, audience-appropriate; foster open communication by leading by example.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pro-activeness: proactively drive value (monetary or knowledge) to the team and business; seek process improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Decision Making &amp;amp; Strategic Thinking: use data and knowledge to make decisions aligned to long-term goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative Innovation/Problem Solving: actively improve processes; encourage the team to contribute ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social Awareness: read the room; flex approach based on audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptability: proactively respond to changing tasks through prioritisation and delegation; remain calm and positive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsibility: clear accountability and ownership of own and direct reports&#39; responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organisation: manage own and team workload; support team members to develop their own organisational methods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time Management: consistently meet deadlines; delegate fairly with appropriate deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influencing Others: develop storytelling techniques to enhance collaboration across the division.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrity/Growth Mindset: proactively challenge yourself; discuss development areas with line manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
