&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG is committed to creating a diverse &amp;amp; inclusive environment and hence welcomes applications from all sections of the community.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Because of the high volumes of applications our opportunities attract, it sometimes takes us time to review and consider them all. We endeavour to respond to every application we receive within 14 days. If you haven&#39;t heard from us within that time frame or should you have any specific questions about this or other applications for positions at THG please contact one of our &lt;span class=&quot;mark75xs2u5gf&quot; data-markjs=&quot;true&quot; data-ogac=&quot;&quot; data-ogab=&quot;&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;&quot;&gt;Talent&lt;/span&gt; team to discuss further.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;Senior Account Executive – Inizio Medical&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manchester / Macclesfield/ London/ Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The opportunity&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you looking for a Senior Account Executive role that will give you exposure to the full breadth of medical communications?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Senior Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt; to join us working across an exciting mix of &lt;strong&gt;publications and Medical Affairs programmes.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a fantastic opportunity for someone who has built a foundation in medical communications and is ready to broaden their experience. You&#39;ll have the chance to develop across a varied portfolio of projects and build your career and experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join a collaborative team where you&#39;ll work with experienced client services and scientific colleagues. You&#39;ll have plenty of opportunity to develop towards the next stage of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Account Executive, you will help deliver multiple medical communications projects from initiation through to completion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage project activities, timelines, trackers and deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across a &lt;strong&gt;broad mix of publications and Medical Affairs projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support publications including &lt;strong&gt;abstracts, posters, manuscripts and congress activities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver Medical Affairs initiatives such as &lt;strong&gt;advisory boards, scientific meetings, medical education and stakeholder engagement activities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be an important contact for clients and build relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate internal scientific, editorial, creative and client services teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support project budgets, financial tracking and invoicing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify potential risks or challenges and working with the wider team to find practical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop your understanding of client strategy and the wider objectives behind each programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who has:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience within a &lt;strong&gt;medical communications agency or similar healthcare communications environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing multiple projects and competing priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organisational and project management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence communicating with clients and team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of the medical communications project lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in &lt;strong&gt;publications and/or Medical Affairs&lt;/strong&gt;, with an interest in developing across both&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and a proactive, solutions-focused approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why join Inizio Medical?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll gain exposure to different project types, clients and ways of working, helping you build a rounded medical communications skill set.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re ready to build on your medical communications experience and take the next step in a role offering &lt;strong&gt;breadth, responsibility and career development&lt;/strong&gt;, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Inizio Medical, we believe our people are our strength. You&#39;ll enjoy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/strong&gt;, including &lt;strong&gt;private medical insurance&lt;/strong&gt; and a &lt;strong&gt;company pension&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible, hybrid working&lt;/strong&gt; options to support work-life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;friendly and inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt; with regular &lt;strong&gt;social events&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;wellbeing initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Town Hall events&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional &lt;strong&gt;career development opportunities&lt;/strong&gt; and access to world-class learning resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to promote a culture of &lt;strong&gt;diversity, inclusion, and belonging&lt;/strong&gt;. We believe our differences make us stronger — and that diversity drives innovation, creativity, and success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid remote/in-office role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don&#39;t meet every job requirement? That&#39;s okay! Our company is dedicated to building a diverse, inclusive, and authentic workplace. If you&#39;re excited about this role, but your experience doesn&#39;t perfectly fit every qualification, we encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right person for this role or others.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.imgur.com/UuLTAa2.png&quot; alt=&quot;disability confident committed&quot; width=&quot;311&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at CreateFuture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://createfuture.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;CreateFuture&lt;/a&gt; is an&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;AI-native consulting partner&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;where people do work that matters and are supported to do it well. We work alongside organisations such as PayPal, adidas, NatWest, FanDuel and Money Saving Expert, building digital products and services that make a difference&amp;nbsp; while always putting people first.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a team of creators. We write code, shape delivery, build go-to-market strategies, develop AI solutions and create the practices that support our people. We work side by side with our clients, challenging what’s not working and helping them to build the future. Our commitment to craft, quality, and culture has helped us scale to over 600 people in just a few years.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;CreateFuture is a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greatplacetowork.co.uk/certified-company/1572759&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Great Place to Work-Certified™ company &lt;/a&gt;and has won Best Workplaces UK multiple years in a row.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us on our journey. Let’s create tomorrow, together, today.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_1bsb1osq _18s8y1gf _p12fukw8&quot; data-testid=&quot;view-page-labels-container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;styles--2BkR3&quot; data-ui=&quot;job-description&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role and team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Lead Data Engineer to own the technical direction of a data engagement, working with Microsoft Fabric, Python, and PySpark across our data team. You&#39;ll lead a team of data engineers, setting the standards for how pipelines and architecture are designed, built, and operated, while remaining hands-on with the most complex technical challenges. You&#39;ll work closely with client stakeholders and CreateFuture&#39;s wider engineering capability to ensure delivery is both technically excellent and commercially sound.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical direction of a data engagement, setting standards for pipeline architecture, data modelling, testing, and operational readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and technically direct a team of data engineers, allocating work, reviewing designs and code, and unblocking technical challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and evolve data platform architecture on Microsoft Fabric, including data pipelines, Azure OneLake, and the broader Azure ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and enforce CI/CD, testing, and operational practices across the engagement&#39;s data engineering workflows, using Azure DevOps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build professional relationships with key client stakeholders, translating business and data requirements into a coherent technical roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve the most complex issues in live data pipelines, and lead incident response when things go wrong&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;d love to talk to you if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have extensive hands-on experience with a modern cloud data platform such as Microsoft Fabric (our current client&#39;s platform), Databricks, Snowflake, or Synapse, including designing production data platforms — the platform is the wrapper, not the skill, and strong engineering depth on one transfers readily to another&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have deep SQL expertise and a strong grasp of data modelling and architecture (Kimball, data vault, medallion/lakehouse patterns, or domain modelling) — this is the clearest line between someone who operates a platform and someone who can design on top of it, and it&#39;s provider-agnostic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong proficiency in Python and PySpark for batch/ELT data processing at scale (this role centres on batch pipeline engineering — we treat streaming/real-time as a separate discipline and never assume the two are interchangeable)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have led or technically directed a team of data engineers, setting standards for pipeline design, testing, and delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience owning CI/CD and operational practices for data engineering workflows, ideally using Azure DevOps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are experienced working directly with client stakeholders, building trust and challenging where appropriate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have familiarity with the broader Azure ecosystem, including Azure OneLake and Azure ML, particularly for model industrialisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;What-we’ll-offer-you:&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8044&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we’ll offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust people to do their best work. That means flexibility over rigid rules, impact over activity, and real investment in your growth both professionally and personally. You’ll be part of a supportive, and friendly culture, surrounded by smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer flexible working, including hybrid and remote options. Our office hubs are located in Edinburgh, Leeds, Manchester, London and Bulgaria, with occasional travel to client sites or CreateFuture offices when needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust you to manage your time balancing collaboration with client time and focused work. What matters is the impact you have, not how busy you look.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We try to keep our hiring process clear, fair and respectful of your time. We aim to get back to everyone who applies and we will be upfront about where you are in the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It usually looks like this:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Call with our Talent Acquisition Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Role specific capability interview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the role, we might also ask you to do a short presentation, a practical or technical task or have a values focused conversation. We will explain what is involved before anything happens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion at CreateFuture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe diverse teams build better workplaces and better products. We want CreateFuture to be a place where people feel able to be themselves and do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any adjustments or support during the application process, just. We will do what we can to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look forward to your application!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Remote&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Remote is solving modern organizations’ biggest challenge – navigating global employment compliantly with ease. We make it possible for businesses of all sizes to recruit, pay, and manage international teams. With our core values at heart and future focused work culture, our team works tirelessly on ambitious problems, asynchronously, around the world. You can find Remoters working from 6 different continents (Antarctica left to go!) and all of our positions are fully remote.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;discussion-id-2f7cb4da-dab4-8068-a80f-001c50b2d808 suggestion-update notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;With Innovation as one of the core values, we have built Automation and AI capabilities into the requirements for every role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We encourage every member of the Remote team to bring their talents, experiences and culture to the table to help us build the best-in-class HR platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you are energetic, curious, motivated and ambitious, be part of our world. Apply now and define the future of work!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;The position&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an exciting time to join Remote and make a personal difference in the global employment space in Employee Lifecycle Operations, by joining our&amp;nbsp;Employee Lifecycle team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Lifecycle Specialist (OHS), you will ensure that all activities related to the occupational health and safety of employees are performed effectively, compliantly, and on time across multiple countries supported by Remote. You will be responsible for identifying, engaging, and managing vendor partnerships, driving contract management processes, and be in charge of rolling out all events related to health and safety across the globe for Remote’s employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be reporting to Employee Lifecycle Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant work experience in a digital environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BA/BS degree or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progressive management plus required examiner experience within Workers’ Compensation insurance industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scouting, onboarding, and/or managing insurance partners and brokers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly engage and support external employees and vendors across multiple countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good analytical skills, ability to map processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player who works independently and communicates proactively and positively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A growth and problem-solving mindset. You can shift tasks and priorities when circumstances change and do so quickly and effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Writes and speaks fluent English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;It is not required to have experience working remotely, but considered a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insurance Portfolio Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in the administration and management of the company’s global insurance programs specifically Worker Compensation insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the renewal process for various insurance programs, ensuring timely and accurate submissions and successful negotiations to drive cost efficiencies and competitiveness in the market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with brokers, insurers, and internal stakeholders to gather the necessary information and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain up-to-date records of insurance policies, certificates of insurance, and related documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk Financing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze and evaluate risk financing options to optimize coverage and cost-efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and present recommendations on risk financing strategies to senior management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in the development and implementation of risk management policies and procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Analysis and Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collect, analyze, and interpret insurance and risk management data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare regular reports and presentations for senior management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify trends, potential risks, and opportunities for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with various internal departments and operating companies to identify and address insurance and risk management needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster strong relationships with clients and external partners, including brokers, insurers, and regulatory agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintains current knowledge of related laws and regulation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Support:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide prospects, customers and their employees with the necessary support on Workers Compensation insurance coverage, exclusions and overall risk management advise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain up-to-date documentation for claims management procedures and records of claims outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with the Occupational Health and Safety team, brokers, and insurers to support the claim management process for both internal and external employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Practicals&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll report to:&lt;/strong&gt; Senior Manager, Contract management, Lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Lifecycle Operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: EMEA&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start date&lt;/strong&gt;: As soon as possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Application process&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with recruiter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with future manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bar Raiser&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background Check&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Remote&#39;s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/remotecom/people-Total-Rewards-1945bce8d3924ece9421ba8630f57b0c&quot;&gt;Total Rewards philosophy&lt;/a&gt; is to ensure fair, unbiased compensation and fair &lt;span class=&quot;link-annotation-unknown-block-id-1691622878&quot;&gt;equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;discussion-level-1 discussion-id-f2a82bc4-09e4-4a71-ad93-755b1d26a690 notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;3&quot;&gt; pay &lt;/span&gt;along with competitive benefits in all locations in which we operate. We do not agree to or encourage cheap-labor practices and therefore we ensure to pay above in-location rates. We hope to inspire other companies to support global talent-hiring and bring local wealth to developing countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At first glance our salary bands seem quite wide - here is some context. At Remote we have international operations and a globally distributed workforce.&amp;nbsp; We use geo ranges to consider geographic pay differentials as part of our global compensation strategy to remain competitive in various markets while we hiring globally.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our salary ranges are determined by role, level and location, and our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay for the successful candidate in this role is dependent upon many factors such as location, transferable or job-related skills, work experience, relevant training, business needs, and market demands. The base salary range may be subject to change.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;At Remote, we foster internal mobility as a key element of our culture of employee growth and development, supported by a compensation philosophy that guarantees pay equity and fairness. Therefore, all compensation changes associated with an internal move will be reviewed by the Total Rewards &amp;amp; People Enablement team on a case by case basis.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual salary range for this full-time position is&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€55.800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€62.800 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our full benefits &amp;amp; perks are explained in our handbook at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://remote.com/r/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://remote.com/r/benefits&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;remote.com/r/benefits&lt;/a&gt;. As a global company, each country works differently, but some benefits/perks are for all Remoters:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;work from anywhere&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;flexible paid time off&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;flexible working hours (we are&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://remote.com/async&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.notion.so/remotecom/Working-Async-at-Remote-80c01cd443ad4c77a8ceaef7c5fba5d0&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;async&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;16 weeks paid parental leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;budget towards &lt;a href=&quot;https://app.notion.com/p/remotecom/Benefits-Perks-1e48a5869c274f40910b76d405b92f63?source=copy_link#3accb4dadab48025b7a6dbc23bc47504&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;co-working spaces, learning and wellness&lt;/a&gt; (including gym memberships)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;mental health support services&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;stock options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;home office budget &amp;amp; IT equipment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you’ll plan your day (and life)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We work async at Remote which means you can plan your schedule around your life (and not around meetings). Read more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://remote.com/async&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;remote.com/async&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will be empowered to take ownership and be proactive. When in doubt you will default to action instead of waiting. Your &lt;strong&gt;life-work balance&lt;/strong&gt; is important and you will be encouraged to put yourself and your family first, and fit work around your needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If that sounds like something you want, apply now!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to apply&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Please fill out the form below and upload your CV with a PDF format.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;We kindly ask you to submit your application and CV in English, as this is the standardised language we use here at Remote.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you don’t have an up to date CV but you are still interested in talking to us, please feel free to add a copy of your LinkedIn profile instead.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Not only do we encourage folks from all ethnic groups, genders, sexuality, age, abilities, disability status and any other under-represented group to apply, but we prioritize a sense of belonging. We have 4 ERGs (Women, Disability, Queer, Minorities in Tech) who meet regularly with the People team. During your interviews and beyond, we ask &amp;amp; encourage anybody who needs an accommodation to request one from their recruiter.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We will ask you to voluntarily tell us your pronouns at interview stage, and you will have the option to answer our anonymous demographic questionnaire when you apply below. As an equal employment opportunity employer it’s important to us that our workforce reflects people of all backgrounds, identities, and experiences and this data will help us to stay accountable. We thank you for providing this data, if you chose to.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Remote, we embrace AI as a valuable tool while prioritizing human creativity and authenticity.&amp;nbsp;We look forward to meeting candidates who balance innovation with genuine expertise and experience.&amp;nbsp;To learn more about Remote&#39;s AI guidelines check see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/remotecom/Guidelines-on-using-AI-when-applying-for-a-job-at-Remote-11ccb4dadab4805f80a7c73b6567bd8f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.notion.so/remotecom/Guidelines-on-using-AI-when-applying-for-a-job-at-Remote-11ccb4dadab4805f80a7c73b6567bd8f&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1733927526443000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2sIVooKuyGfRra1PtGXreV&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note we accept applications on an ongoing basis.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notre équipe Decathlon App recherche un·e Staff Product Manager (f/m/d) en CDI basé·e à Lille ou Paris.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au cœur de l&#39;écosystème digital de Decathlon, l&#39;équipe &lt;strong&gt;Decathlon App&lt;/strong&gt; fait le pont entre nos expériences e-commerce et le commerce physique. Notre mission dépasse la simple transaction : nous construisons un compagnon sportif quotidien, personnalisé et enrichi pour accompagner des millions d&#39;utilisateur·ices dans leur pratique. Rejoindre notre équipe produit globale (iOS &amp;amp; Android), c&#39;est évoluer dans un environnement stimulant où l&#39;autonomie, l&#39;impact à grande échelle et l&#39;excellence méthodologique sont au cœur de nos défis quotidiens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que Staff Product Manager (f/m/d), tu apporteras la vision stratégique et l&#39;architecture fonctionnelle nécessaires pour faire passer notre application mobile à l&#39;échelle supérieure. Tu opéreras avec une grande autonomie sur des enjeux complexes pour transformer l&#39;expérience Decathlon App et garantir la cohérence de l&#39;écosystème.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tes responsabilités s&#39;articulent autour de 4 piliers stratégiques :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alignement stratégique, gestion des parties prenantes &amp;amp; vision app&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter la valeur globale (&lt;em&gt;macro view&lt;/em&gt;) générée par les initiatives mobiles clés sur l&#39;ensemble de l&#39;écosystème business et client, au-delà des backlogs d&#39;équipes individuelles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Porter la vision produit auprès de la direction exécutive, des leaders business et des parties prenantes transversales pour aligner l&#39;organisation sur la roadmap de l&#39;application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définir les orientations stratégiques sur les segments utilisateurs prioritaires sur les points de contact mobiles natifs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suivre et optimiser les métriques de performance macro tout au long du funnel : notoriété, trafic, conversion, rétention et taux de réachat.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture fonctionnelle &amp;amp; orchestration End-to-End&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agir en tant qu&#39;Architecte Fonctionnel·le principal·e en définissant la répartition des périmètres entre les squads afin d&#39;éliminer les frictions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travailler en triade étroite avec les Staff Tech/Principal Engineers et les Staff UX Designers pour aligner l&#39;architecture technique, les systèmes de design et la vision produit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concevoir des parcours omnicanaux sans couture reliant la découverte mobile, les interactions en magasin (ex: Scan &amp;amp; Go, retrait), le paiement et les services sportifs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sparring stratégique &amp;amp; de-risking produit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conseiller et accompagner les Group Product Managers (GPM) et Product Managers (PM) face aux dépendances complexes de l&#39;application et aux pièges classiques du produit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structurer des stratégies de réduction des risques (&lt;em&gt;de-risking&lt;/em&gt;) sur les projets majeurs pour identifier au plus tôt les enjeux d&#39;appétence, de viabilité et d&#39;utilisabilité.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mener des boucles de validation concrètes (A/B testing, multivariés, tests d&#39;utilisabilité de prototypes) pour valider les hypothèses avant le déploiement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Élévation de la culture &amp;amp; des pratiques produit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accompagner la communauté PM vers les meilleures pratiques produit modernes (frameworks de discovery, expérimentation continue, Opportunity Solution Trees - OST).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promouvoir l&#39;adoption des possibilités liées à l&#39;IA et des méthodologies avancées pour enrichir l&#39;expérience utilisateur et l&#39;efficacité des squads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Jouer un rôle de multiplicateur d&#39;impact pour faire grandir la communauté Produit, sans agir en tant que manager hiérarchique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE TU APPORTES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience Mobile Native&lt;/strong&gt; : Solide parcours (7 ans+) en gestion de produits avec une expérience terrain dans la mise à l&#39;échelle d&#39;applications mobiles natives (iOS &amp;amp; Android) dans des environnements digitaux à fort volume.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complexité E-commerce &amp;amp; Retail&lt;/strong&gt; : Solide expérience dans l&#39;e-commerce, les plateformes digitales ou le retail omnicanal où les produits digitaux se connectent directement aux points de contact opérationnels physiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact transversal&lt;/strong&gt; : Expérience démontrée dans l&#39;alignement inter-équipes et les initiatives architecturales au sein d&#39;organisations produit multi-équipes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stratégie d&#39;Application Native&lt;/strong&gt; : Compréhension approfondie des paradigmes de design iOS/Android, des mécaniques des app stores, de l&#39;analytics mobile et des stratégies d&#39;engagement via push.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery &amp;amp; Analytics&lt;/strong&gt; : Expertise des méthodes de discovery quantitatives et qualitatives, de l&#39;A/B testing, de l&#39;optimisation de conversion (CRO) et des Opportunity Solution Trees (OST).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture fonctionnelle&lt;/strong&gt; : Capacité à structurer des problèmes business complexes en stratégies de MVP/V0/V1 claires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication exécutive&lt;/strong&gt; : Aisance pour traduire des architectures produit, des métriques UX et des données en présentations claires et convaincantes pour les dirigeants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IA &amp;amp; Outils modernes&lt;/strong&gt; : Curiosité et expérience pratique de l&#39;intégration de l&#39;IA dans les workflows produit et les expériences utilisateurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Posture &amp;amp; Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence stratégique et intelligence émotionnelle (leadership sans autorité hiérarchique).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacité à s&#39;épanouir dans l&#39;ambiguïté et à structurer des défis complexes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Esprit de collaboration fort en Triade (Tech, Design, UXR, Data, Business).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empathie et volonté de transmettre aux PM plus juniors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE NOUS T’OFFRONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organisation de travail hybride ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Matériel fourni en accord avec tes missions et nos engagements sociétaux (Mac ou Windows) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une équipe de projet locale au sein d&#39;un réseau mondial (possibilité de carrière internationale) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développement des compétences et accompagnement (diversité des projets, formations internes et externes, etc.) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Package de rémunération (actionnariat salarié, bonus mensuels/trimestriels).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NOTRE ENGAGEMENT EN FAVEUR DE L&#39;INCLUSION ET DE L&#39;ACCESSIBILITE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Decathlon, nous reconnaissons l&#39;immense valeur qu&#39;apporte la diversité à nos équipes et nous nous efforçons continuellement de favoriser et de cultiver un lieu de travail inclusif et équitable : c&#39;est pourquoi l&#39;Inclusion est l&#39;un de nos Fondamentaux Humains. Nous encourageons les personnes de tous horizons et de toutes capacités à postuler, car nous sommes convaincu·es que la diversité des pensées, des cultures, des identités et des expériences vécues nous rend plus fort·es. Decathlon s&#39;engage également à offrir un processus de sélection inclusif et accessible à tous les candidat·es. En cas de besoin d&#39;aménagement, tu peux en faire la demande via le formulaire de candidature, celle-ci sera confidentielle. Ces demandes n&#39;affectent pas le résultat du processus de recrutement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🇬🇧 ENGLISH VERSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Decathlon App team is looking for a Staff Product Manager (f/m/d) on a Permanent Contract (CDI) based in Lille or Paris.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the core of Decathlon&#39;s digital ecosystem, the &lt;strong&gt;Decathlon App&lt;/strong&gt; team acts as the ultimate bridge between our digital commerce and physical store experiences. Our mission goes beyond transactions: we are building an indispensable daily sports companion for millions of users. Joining our global mobile team (iOS &amp;amp; Android) means evolving in a high-impact environment where autonomy, scaling challenges, and product excellence drive everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Product Manager (f/m/d), you will provide the strategic direction and functional architecture needed to scale our mobile platform across multiple product teams. Operating with high autonomy, you will address complex challenges to shape our long-term app experience and guarantee ecosystem cohesion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission centers on 4 strategic pillars:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Alignment, Stakeholder Management &amp;amp; App Vision&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the holistic value (&lt;em&gt;macro view&lt;/em&gt;) generated by key mobile initiatives across the business and customer ecosystem, moving beyond individual squad backlogs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver high-impact narratives and presentations to executive leadership, business directors, and cross-functional stakeholders to align the organization on major platform shifts and app roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set strategic direction for key user segments across native mobile touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and optimize macro success metrics across the entire journey: Awareness, Traffic, Conversion, Retention, and Repeat Purchase Rate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Functional Architecture &amp;amp; End-to-End Orchestration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the lead Functional Architect, defining how functional scope and boundaries are distributed across app feature squads to eliminate overlap and friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in tight Triad Collaboration with Staff/Principal Engineers and Staff UX Designers to align technical architecture, mobile design systems, and product vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design seamless, connected user journeys linking mobile discovery, in-store interactions (e.g., Scan &amp;amp; Go, store pickup), checkout, and sports services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Sparring &amp;amp; Product De-Risking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted strategic advisor and sparring partner for Group Product Managers (GPMs) and PMs to help them navigate complex app dependencies and product traps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formulate and drive product de-risking strategies for high-stakes app initiatives, identifying desirability, viability, and usability risks early in discovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and run concrete validation loops (A/B tests, multivariate testing, prototype usability tests) to validate hypotheses before engineering deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elevating Product Craft &amp;amp; Mastery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upskill the PM community on modern product practices, standardizing discovery frameworks, continuous experimentation, and Opportunity Solution Trees (OST).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive organizational adoption of AI-first possibilities and advanced product methodologies to amplify app experience and squad efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a force multiplier: elevate the collective bar of the product management community without operating as a formal people manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING TO THE TABLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mobile Native Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;: Proven track record (7+ years) in Product Management with deep hands-on experience scaling native mobile applications (iOS &amp;amp; Android) in high-scale digital environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;E-Commerce &amp;amp; Retail Complexity&lt;/strong&gt;: Solid background in e-commerce, digital platforms, or omnichannel retail where digital products connect directly with physical operational touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transverse Scale&lt;/strong&gt;: Demonstrated experience driving cross-squad alignment and architectural initiatives across multi-team product organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Native App Product Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: Deep understanding of iOS/Android design paradigms, app store mechanics, mobile analytics, and push engagement strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Discovery &amp;amp; De-Risking&lt;/strong&gt;: Expertise in quantitative and qualitative discovery methods, CRO, A/B testing frameworks, and Opportunity Solution Trees (OST).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Functional Architecture &amp;amp; Scoping&lt;/strong&gt;: Ability to structure complex business problems into clear MVP/V0/V1 scoping playbooks and boundary maps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Communication &amp;amp; Storytelling&lt;/strong&gt;: Ability to translate complex product architectures, UX metrics, and data insights into clear, persuasive executive presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Modern Product Stack&lt;/strong&gt;: Curiosity and practical experience integrating AI capabilities into product workflows and user experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills &amp;amp; Behaviors:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Influence &amp;amp; Emotional Intelligence (influencing without hierarchical authority).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thriving in Ambiguity (highly autonomous self-starter).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Triad &amp;amp; Cross-Functional Collaboration (Staff Tech, Staff Design, UXR, Data, Business).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth Mindset &amp;amp; Empathy (humble approach and dedicating time to mentor).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work organization;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equipment provided tailored to your role and our sustainability commitments (Mac or Windows);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Local project team within a global network (international career opportunities);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous skills development and support (diverse projects, internal and external training, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive compensation package (employee stock ownership, monthly/quarterly bonuses).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO INCLUSION AND ACCESSIBILITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Decathlon, we recognize the immense value that diversity brings to our teams, and we continuously strive to foster and cultivate an inclusive and equitable workplace: this is why Inclusion is one of our Human Fundamentals. We encourage people of all backgrounds and abilities to apply, as we are convinced that diversity of thought, culture, identity, and lived experience makes us stronger. Decathlon is also committed to offering an inclusive and accessible recruitment process for all candidates. If you require any reasonable accommodations during the process, you can request them via the application form, and your request will remain confidential. These requests will not affect the outcome of your hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Shift delivers AI agents that transform insurers&#39; most critical work. By combining deep industry expertise and unmatched data resources, Shift provides proven results that have earned the trust of hundreds of the world&#39;s leading insurers. Our insurance-grade AI is accurate, explainable, and secure—empowering human experts to move with unmatched speed, total confidence, and a renewed focus on the people they serve.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;video poster=&quot;https://8595762.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/8595762/2026%20Website%20Refresh/2026%20Shift%20Brand%20Video/thumbnail-violet.jpg&quot; controls=&quot;controls&quot; width=&quot;300&quot; height=&quot;150&quot;&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;source src=&quot;https://8595762.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/8595762/2026%20Website%20Refresh/2026%20Shift%20Brand%20Video/2026%20Shift%20Brand%20Video%20(English).mp4&quot; type=&quot;video/mp4&quot;&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Your browser does not support the video tag.&lt;/video&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Our culture is built on innovation, trust, and a drive to transform the insurance industry through our SaaS platform. We come from more than 50 different countries and cultures and together we are creating the future of insurance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.shift-technology.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.shift-technology.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shift Technology :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shift is the leading AI platform for insurance. Shift combines generative, agentic, and predictive AI to transform underwriting, claims, and fraud and risk - driving operational efficiency, exceptional customer experiences and measurable business impact. Trusted by the world&#39;s leading insurers, Shift delivers AI when and where it matters most, at scale and with proven results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Data Science Team🤖:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Data Science team works on a broad range of subjects. We actively participate in the definition and development of our suite of products on fraud detection, anti-money laundering and claim automation. We have a lot of technical and professional experience in data science, data engineering, coding, business understanding, and client interactions. Additionally, we also work on various data types such as structured data, free text, documents, and images.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your key responsibilities will include🧑‍💻:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Setting up and deploying data processing pipelines, such as data reception (batch or real-time), data cleaning, information extraction, and calibration of fraud detection models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting R&amp;amp;D to drive product innovation (machine learning, NLP, image analysis, trend analysis, chatbots, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering in an entire Data Science product lifecycle: understand how sales, legal, product, and engineering are connected together to deliver an AI product to clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your profile and requirements✅:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are currently enrolled as a master&#39;s degree student in either Mathematics,&amp;nbsp; Statistics, Computer Science, Machine learning and/or Big Data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You must be able to provide an internship agreement (Convention de stage) signed by your school or university&lt;strong&gt; for 6 months&lt;/strong&gt; and you are able&lt;strong&gt; to start your internship in&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; NOVEMBER 2026&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience in object-oriented programming (OOP) such as prior internship, school and/or personal projects so you can write quality production code. Prior experience using C# is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;French is mandatory at a fluent level and you can communicate clearly in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join Shift Technology as a Data Scientist Intern ?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤸‍♀️Flexibility, autonomy and adaptability are part of our core values: we are a horizontal organization without bureaucracy (40% of staff are data scientists) but optimal and reduced line management, focus on delivery and development while having a hybrid model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠Learn from inside an AI leader tech company: join the 13th French Unicorn providing hands on training, workshop and sessions with highly experienced AI research Team.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💶Your commitment, our investment: 2000€ gross monthly gratification, high&amp;nbsp; conversion rate to full time employee, dedicated HR partner, regular reviews and feedback sessions with your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌍Be part of an international and diverse tech firm: full english speaking environment with 55 different nationalities across the world and 11 offices locations (Paris, Singapore, Tokyo, Sao Paulo, Mexico City, Boston, Madrid, London, Toronto, ...)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤝Dealing with big clients and developing business skills &amp;amp; knowledge: real life experience with insurance business challenges inside the world of AI.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is next ? 🎯&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If your application and experience meet our requirements, you can expect :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Talent Acquisition interview (30 min)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical interview 1 (60 min)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical interview 2 (60 min)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hiring manager interview (60 min)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The interview process can take 2 to 3 weeks, depending on the interviewer&#39;s availability. Be sure that we are doing our best to get back to you with an answer as fast as possible. If you are not getting an update on your application after 10 days, please reach out to our email address.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;To support our permanent, full time employees at every stage of their careers and lives, we provide a competitive total rewards and benefits package. Here are the global benefits we’d like to highlight:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Flexible remote and hybrid working options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary and a variable component tied to personal and company performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Multiple Learning and Development opportunities, including Focus Fridays, a half-day each month to focus on learning and personal growth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO and paid holidays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Mental health benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;2 MAD Days per year (Make A Difference Days for paid volunteering)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Additional benefits may be offered by country, based on your eligibility - ask your recruiter for more information. Intern and Apprentice positions may receive some of these benefits - ask your recruiter for more details.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI tools are used to help review applications for this role. Read our &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.shift-technology.com/hubfs/AI%20in%20Recruitment%20Notice%20May%202026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AI in Recruitment Notice&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;for what the AI considers, how to request a human review, and our most recent bias audit.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Shift we strive to be a diverse and inclusive workforce. &lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We welcome applications from and hire people who will contribute to the diversity of our company,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;without regard to race, color, religion, marital status, age, national or ethnic origin, physical or mental disability, medical condition, pregnancy, genetic information, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, or other non-merit criteria. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Shift Technology is committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities in our application and employment process. Should you require accommodation, please email ----- and we will work with you to meet your accessibility needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please be aware of scammers and only trust correspondence that comes from emails ending in &quot;shift-technology.com&quot;. We will never do initial outreach to you via Whatsapp/Text/SMS, never ask for banking information or personal identification numbers (ex. Social Security Number) as part of our recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 8pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Shift Technology does not accept unsolicited CVs from recruiters or employment agencies in response to the Shift Technology Careers page or a Shift Technology social media post. Any unsolicited CVs, including those submitted directly to hiring managers, are deemed to be the property of Shift Technology. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Senior Data Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;AI Team&lt;/strong&gt; working on our &lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;AI Medical Companion&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Your mission will be to build and optimize the data foundations that power safe, scalable, and impactful AI models. You will work on data infrastructure for &lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;LLM, VLM, and RAG-based systems&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring our engineers and data scientists can &lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;train, evaluate, and deploy AI models&lt;/strong&gt; efficiently on high-quality, well-structured, and compliant data. Your work will directly support health professionals in delivering better care while improving their work-life balance, ultimately impacting 80 million patients and 400,000 healthcare professionals across Europe.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Working in the tech team at Doctolib means building innovative products and features to improve the daily lives of care teams and patients.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Design, build, and maintain scalable data pipelines on&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Google Cloud Platform (GCP)&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for AI and machine learning use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Implement data ingestion and transformation frameworks that power&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Retrieval systems&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;training datasets&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for LLMs and multimodal models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Architect and manage&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;NoSQL and Vector Databases&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to store and retrieve embeddings, documents, and model inputs efficiently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Collaborate with ML and platform teams to define data schemas, partitioning strategies, and governance rules that ensure privacy, scalability, and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Integrate unstructured and structured data sources (text, speech, image, documents, metadata) into unified data models ready for AI consumption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Optimize performance and cost of data pipelines using GCP native services (BigQuery, Dataflow, Pub/Sub, Cloud Storage, Vertex AI)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Contribute to data quality and lineage frameworks, ensuring AI models are trained on validated, auditable, and compliant datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Continuously evaluate and improve our data stack to accelerate AI experimentation and deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Before you read on: if you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have &lt;strong&gt;7&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;in Data Engineering, ideally supporting&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;AI or ML workloads&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have strong experience with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;GCP data ecosystem&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and proficiency in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Python and SQL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have deep understanding of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;NoSQL systems&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(e.g., MongoDB) and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;vector databases&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(e.g., FAISS, Vector Search)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have experience designing&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;data architectures for RAG, embeddings, or model training pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have knowledge of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;data governance, security, and compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for sensitive or regulated data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You are fluent in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;It would be fantastic if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You hold a Master&#39;s or Ph.D. degree in Computer Science, Data Engineering, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have familiarity with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;W&amp;amp;B / MLflow / Braintrust / DVC&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for experiment tracking and dataset versioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have experience with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;containerized environments&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(Docker, Kubernetes) and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;CI/CD for data workflows&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Life at Doctolib Tech&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Our solutions are built on a single fully cloud-native platform that supports web and mobile app interfaces, multiple languages, and is adapted to country and healthcare specialty requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Our stack is composed of Rails, TypeScript, Java, Python, Kotlin, Swift, and React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;We leverage AI ethically across our products to empower patients and health professionals. Discover our AI vision&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;s-break-all s-font-semibold s-transition-all s-duration-200 s-ease-in-out hover:s-underline s-text-highlight dark:s-text-highlight-night hover:s-text-highlight-400 dark:hover:s-text-highlight-400-night active:s-text-highlight-dark dark:active:s-text-highlight-dark-night&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/ai-careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to learn more about our tech culture and environment? Visit the&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;s-break-all s-font-semibold s-transition-all s-duration-200 s-ease-in-out hover:s-underline s-text-highlight dark:s-text-highlight-night hover:s-text-highlight-400 dark:hover:s-text-highlight-400-night active:s-text-highlight-dark dark:active:s-text-highlight-dark-night&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Doctolib Tech site&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Free comprehensive health insurance (basic package) for you and your children&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;25 days of paid vacation per year, plus up to 14 days of RTT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Free mental health and coaching services through our partner Moka.care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Work from abroad for up to 10 days per year thanks to our flexibility days policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Lunch vouchers (Swile card) worth €8.50 per working day, with €4.50 covered by Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;A subsidy from the work council to refund part of the membership to a sport club or a creative class&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;50% reimbursement of your public transport subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Parent Care Program: receive one additional month of leave on top of the legal parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Enrollment in Doctolib&#39;s long-term employee value sharing plan called DoctoGrowth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;For caregivers and workers with disabilities, a package including an adaptation of the remote policy, extra days off for medical reasons, and psychological support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Relocation support in case of international mobility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Access to the best AI tools for coding, development and dedicated training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Our interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Recruiter Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;AI Coding Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;System Design Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Behavioral Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;At least one reference check&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;We want your experience to be clear, respectful, and transparent. Learn more about our hiring process on our &lt;a class=&quot;s-break-all s-font-semibold s-transition-all s-duration-200 s-ease-in-out hover:s-underline s-text-highlight dark:s-text-highlight-night hover:s-text-highlight-400 dark:hover:s-text-highlight-400-night active:s-text-highlight-dark dark:active:s-text-highlight-dark-night&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/getting-hired/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;candidate experience page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Job details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Permanent position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Tech stack: GCP, Python, SQL, NoSQL, Vector Databases, AI/ML&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Full-time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Paris&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Hybrid work setup (up to 2 remote days per week)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Start date: as soon as possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;We welcome everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This translates into our recruitment process. We evaluate candidates based solely on qualifications and motivation, without any form of discrimination.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the more our product will truly improve healthcare for all. You are welcome to apply to Doctolib, regardless of your gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, or disability.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;To ensure equal opportunities, we invite you to exclude personal information (e.g., pictures, age) from your applications. If you require any accommodation, please let us know for support during the hiring process.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Your data privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;All information provided is processed by Doctolib for application management. For data processing details, click here:&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;s-break-all s-font-semibold s-transition-all s-duration-200 s-ease-in-out hover:s-underline s-text-highlight dark:s-text-highlight-night hover:s-text-highlight-400 dark:hover:s-text-highlight-400-night active:s-text-highlight-dark dark:active:s-text-highlight-dark-night&quot; href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-DE&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Germany&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;l&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;s-break-all s-font-semibold s-transition-all s-duration-200 s-ease-in-out hover:s-underline s-text-highlight dark:s-text-highlight-night hover:s-text-highlight-400 dark:hover:s-text-highlight-400-night active:s-text-highlight-dark dark:active:s-text-highlight-dark-night&quot; href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-FR&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;France&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;l&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;s-break-all s-font-semibold s-transition-all s-duration-200 s-ease-in-out hover:s-underline s-text-highlight dark:s-text-highlight-night hover:s-text-highlight-400 dark:hover:s-text-highlight-400-night active:s-text-highlight-dark dark:active:s-text-highlight-dark-night&quot; href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-IT&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Italy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;l&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;s-break-all s-font-semibold s-transition-all s-duration-200 s-ease-in-out hover:s-underline s-text-highlight dark:s-text-highlight-night hover:s-text-highlight-400 dark:hover:s-text-highlight-400-night active:s-text-highlight-dark dark:active:s-text-highlight-dark-night&quot; href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-COM&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Netherlands&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;. Please contact hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com for inquiries or to exercise your rights.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notre équipe Finance Data recherche un·e Product Manager basé·e à Lille ou Paris.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_6904b8d41c6c975f-334&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;17&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0&quot;&gt;Au sein de l&#39;équipe Finance Data &amp;amp; AI, nous transformons en profondeur le pilotage de la performance commerciale et financière. Notre objectif : faire évoluer le contrôle de gestion traditionnel (FP&amp;amp;A) d&#39;un reporting manuel à un pilotage stratégique automatisé et prescripteur, propulsé par l&#39;IA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;17,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_6904b8d41c6c975f-335&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;18,0&quot;&gt;En tant que Product Manager Finance Data, vous intégrez une équipe pluridisciplinaire (Data Engineers, AI Engineers, Analytics Engineers et experts métiers)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;18,2&quot;&gt;. Vous pilotez le développement et l&#39;expansion à l&#39;échelle internationale de notre portefeuille de solutions IA dédiées à la transformation des métiers du FP&amp;amp;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;18,4&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que Data Project Manager, vous aurez l’occasion de :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mener l&#39;exploration continue et la product discovery en contact avec le métier&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mener des travaux de recherche sur de nouveaux produits d’advanced analytics, d’intelligence artificielle ou d’autres solutions novatrices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définir les KPIs sur lesquels s’animer et estimer la création de valeur&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Créer, maintenir, prioriser et communiquer sur le backlog produit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsabiliser l’équipe sur les livraisons: respect des principes structurants inhérents aux données de ton produit, prise en compte de la qualité&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mettre en place les processus de product management pour optimiser la gestion de la zone insight Finance, qui contient l&#39;ensemble des indicateurs du domaine (discovery, backlog management, TTM measurement,...)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Élaborer la roadmap et la planification de futures créations d&#39;indicateurs et métriques en alignant les besoins du métier&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formaliser dans le wiki organisé de la vue technique et des data nécessaires&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accompagner les développeurs BI Eng, Analytics engineers et AI engineers dans la création des indicateurs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mettre en place des process de Run, de mesure du Run et d&#39;auditabilité pour garantir la disponibilité et la sécurité des indicateurs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gérer les accès des utilisateurs finaux et data à nos solutions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définir l&#39;accès aux outils en fonction des usages de la data finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pratiquer les méthodes agiles et participer à l’ensemble des cérémonies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;STACK TECHNIQUE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Environnement AWS (S3, Athena...)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databricks: Genie, Apps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technos/langages : Python, SQL, Spark / Scala, Airflow, DBT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE TU APPORTES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez déjà plusieurs expériences réussies (3 ans minimum hors alternance) en tant que Product Manager sur des projets data ou digitaux.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez un état d&#39;esprit agile tourné vers l&#39;amélioration continue et l&#39;intelligence collective. Vous êtes passionné-e de projet et aimez partager et contribuer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez de bonnes capacités de communication et de collaborations, spécialement dans un environnement international (niveau d’anglais B2 minimum)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Les projets challengeant vous motivent et vous souhaitez prendre des responsabilités rapidement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous êtes passionné-e de sport et vous aimez vivre vos passions en équipe !&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez envie de rejoindre une entreprise à impact positif&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE NOUS T’OFFRONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 jours de télétravail par semaine ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possibilité de travailler dans l&#39;un des bureaux de Decathlon Digital à Lille ou Paris ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Matériel fourni en accord avec tes missions et nos engagements sociétaux (Mac, Windows, ou Chromebooks) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une équipe de projet locale au sein d&#39;un réseau mondial (possibilité de carrière internationale) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développement des compétences et accompagnement (diversité des projets, certifications techniques dès la première année, formations internes et externes, etc.) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Package de rémunération (participation des employés aux actions de l&#39;entreprise, bonus mensuels/trimestriels).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Notre équipe&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Sports&lt;/strong&gt; recherche un·e &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;41&quot;&gt;Software Engineer Android &lt;/strong&gt;basé·e à&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;68&quot;&gt;Lille&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre sens : &lt;strong&gt;&quot;Bring people together through sport to make wellbeing accessible for all.&quot;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;Chez Decathlon, notre ambition est claire : rassembler autour du sport et rendre le bien-être accessible au plus grand nombre. &lt;br&gt;Pour donner vie à cet objectif, nous nous appuyons sur deux forces majeures :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nos coéquipiers, qui sont le cœur battant de notre écosystème.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Notre ancrage local, qui nous lie à chaque communauté sportive pour offrir des solutions uniques (produits, services et expériences).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour propulser cette vision, le Digital est un levier clé.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ton futur terrain de jeu : la Digital Sport Unit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Véritable trait d&#39;union entre nos marques sportives et le digital, cette équipe conçoit les solutions de demain. &lt;br&gt;En nous rejoignant, tu auras un impact direct : tu contribueras à créer et déployer des produits, services et expériences digitales pour simplifier le quotidien de nos coéquipiers et enchanter la pratique de nos utilisateurs sportifs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Le &lt;strong&gt;Connected Locker&lt;/strong&gt;, c&#39;est le cœur logiciel qui fait le pont entre tous nos produits physiques (vélos, tapis, montres) et l&#39;écosystème digital de Decathlon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ton défi ?&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Absorber la complexité.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Chaque produit a ses propres protocoles et spécificités hardware ; le rôle du CL est d&#39;unifier tout cela dans une librairie&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;modulaire&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;et robuste pour que les développeurs d&#39;applications (Decathlon HUB, Mobility..) puissent intégrer n&#39;importe quel équipement en quelques lignes de code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TES MISSIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Architecture Modulaire &amp;amp; Design de SDK :&lt;/strong&gt; Concevoir et faire évoluer une architecture Kotlin découplée et évolutive, permettant d&#39;ajouter de nouveaux types de produits sans réécrire le cœur du système..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;onnectivité Hybride &amp;amp; IoT :&lt;/strong&gt; Maîtriser le stack Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) sous Android (gestion des cycles de vie, scans, reconnexions, spécificités constructeurs/ROMs) pour le local, et le MQTT/REST pour la communication Cloud&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Développement d&#39;une &quot;Test App&quot; :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Développer et maintenir une application de test dédiée (Jetpack Compose).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Permettre aux QA de valider les fonctionnalités du SDK en isolation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Intégrer des outils de simulation (mocking) pour tester les cas d&#39;erreurs hardware difficiles à reproduire en réel&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Abstraction (L&#39;Art du SDK Android) :&lt;/strong&gt; Créer des API publiques simples et idiomatiques (Kotlin Coroutines / Flow) pour masquer la complexité des machines d&#39;états hardware aux applications utilisatrices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;STACK TECHNIQUE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;20,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Langage :&lt;/strong&gt; Kotlin (100%)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;20,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Asynchronisme :&lt;/strong&gt; Coroutines, StateFlow / SharedFlow&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;20,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Connectivité / IoT :&lt;/strong&gt; Android BLE Stack, MQTT (ex: Paho/HiveMQ), AWS IoT Core, REST / WebSockets&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;20,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;UI (Test App) :&lt;/strong&gt; Jetpack Compose&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;20,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; Injection :&lt;/strong&gt; Clean Architecture, Dependency Injection (Hilt / Koin)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;20,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Outillage / CI-CD :&lt;/strong&gt; Gradle (Build Logic / Version Catalogs), Git, CI/CD pipelines pour publication de SDK/AAR.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE DONT TU AS BESOIN POUR RÉUSSIR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es un·e &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;23,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;expert·e Kotlin / Android&lt;/strong&gt; avec une vraie &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;23,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;52&quot;&gt;vision &quot;Plateforme / SDK&quot;&lt;/strong&gt; (tu penses bibliothèque/AAR recontextualisable avant de penser écran/UI).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu maîtrises le &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;23,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;BLE sous Android&lt;/strong&gt; et connais ses pièges (permissions, restrictions arrière-plan, variations selon les versions d&#39;OS/constructeurs), et tu es à l&#39;aise avec les protocoles réseau temps réel (MQTT).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as une solide expérience en &lt;strong&gt;architecture logicielle&lt;/strong&gt; (Design Patterns, Modularité, Injection de dépendances).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es basé à &lt;strong&gt;Lille&lt;/strong&gt;, prêt à tester ton code sur les machines de sport à 50m de ton bureau.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une appétence forte pour le travail en équipe et une culture du partage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un intérêt pour l’impact du sport sur le développement personnel et collectif&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;L’envie de rejoindre une entreprise engagée dans le Tech4Good et l’innovation responsable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;POURQUOI NOUS REJOINDRE ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Decathlon, nous mettons un point d’honneur à offrir un cadre de travail épanouissant et motivant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organisation de travail hybride (2 jours de télétravail par semaine);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Matériel fourni en accord avec tes missions et nos engagements sociétaux (Mac, Windows, ou Chromebooks) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une équipe de projet locale au sein d&#39;un réseau mondial (possibilité de carrière internationale) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développement des compétences et accompagnement (diversité des projets, certifications techniques dès la première année, formations internes et externes, etc.) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Package de rémunération (participation des employés aux actions de l&#39;entreprise, bonus mensuels/trimestriels).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 &lt;strong&gt;Un environnement de travail stimulant&lt;/strong&gt; : entreprise certifiée &lt;strong&gt;Great Place to Work&lt;/strong&gt; et &lt;strong&gt;Happy Trainees&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Des avantages attractifs&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;(après 3 mois d’ancienneté)&lt;/em&gt; :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Primes mensuelles, intéressement, actionnariat&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avantages CSE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;25% de réduction&lt;/strong&gt; sur nos produits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remboursement de 50%&lt;/strong&gt; du titre de transport &amp;amp; aide à la mobilité urbaine&lt;br&gt;🎯 &lt;strong&gt;Un accompagnement sur mesure&lt;/strong&gt; : coaching, formations internes et externes, partage de connaissances.&lt;br&gt;⚡ &lt;strong&gt;Une culture du sport et du test produit&lt;/strong&gt; : deviens ambassadeur.trice de nos innovations et rejoins nos équipes sportives internes !&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Je ne connais pas le secteur du sport, ai-je ma place chez Decathlon ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bien sûr ! Nous recherchons avant tout des personnes &lt;strong&gt;passionnées&lt;/strong&gt; et motivées, que ce soit dans leur domaine d’expertise ou par le sport en général.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Dans le cadre de l’ouverture d’un poste en CDI, nous recrutons un.e &lt;strong&gt;AI engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, basé-e au choix à Paris.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 CONTEXTE &amp;amp; ENJEUX STRATÉGIQUES&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein de Decathlon Digital, l&#39;équipe People Data engage une initiative majeure : transformer l&#39;expérience de nos 100 000 collaborateurs par l&#39;intégration de l&#39;IA Générative et Agentique.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Face à la fragmentation de l&#39;écosystème RH dans plus de 70 pays, notre ambition est de construire une couche de simplification en s’appuyant sur les nouvelles solutions que proposent l’IA. Il s&#39;agit d&#39;une couche d&#39;intelligence centralisée et agnostique des outils, capable d&#39;interagir avec l&#39;ensemble de notre infrastructure (Workday, Data Lake, University, ...) pour faire évoluer nos interfaces d&#39;une logique de consultation vers une logique d&#39;action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dans ce cadre, nous développons &lt;strong&gt;DaiLY&lt;/strong&gt;, notre agent conversationnel RH. Il aide nos collaborateurs et managers à accéder instantanément à une information fiable, sourcée à partir de notre documentation Workday et de nos politiques People.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Déjà déployé avec succès en France, DaiLY entre dans une nouvelle phase de passage à l&#39;échelle : extension internationale, industrialisation des évaluations, amélioration continue de nos modèles et de leurs qualités et déploiement et intégration d’agents autonomes RH.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour mener ce projet, nous ne recherchons pas uniquement un.e développeur.se, nous avons besoin d&#39;un.e &quot;&lt;strong&gt;Builder&lt;/strong&gt;&quot; : un.e personne capable de traduire un besoin métier en solution technique, de l’implémenter, la qualifier, la déployer et la maintenir dans le temps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;🎯 VOTRE MISSION&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recherchons un(e) &lt;strong&gt;AI Engineer confirmé(e)&lt;/strong&gt; pour participer activement à l&#39;industrialisation et au développement de DaiLY. Votre objectif est clair : transformer les besoins métiers RH en fonctionnalités IA fiables, mesurables et robustes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour relever ce défi, vous évoluerez au &lt;strong&gt;sein d&#39;un collectif dédié&lt;/strong&gt;, en collaboration directe avec d&#39;autres AI Engineers, un Lead AI Engineer (qui orientera les choix d&#39;architecture globale) et une Product Manager. Cette organisation de proximité vous permettra d&#39;assurer une synergie parfaite entre les enjeux produits, la roadmap et l&#39;implémentation technique.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous aurez notamment un rôle clé dans l&#39;évolution de DaiLY : passer d&#39;un modèle de simple consultation (Q&amp;amp;A) à un &lt;strong&gt;véritable système agentique transactionnel&lt;/strong&gt; capable de déclencher des actions concrètes (ex : poser des congés dans Workday, s&#39;inscrire à des formations via Decathlon University).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🛠 VOS RESPONSABILITES&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développement Agentique &amp;amp; Fonctionnalités&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer à l&#39;extension des capacités de DaiLY vers des actions d&#39;écriture (write actions) en implémentant des protocoles de tool-calling (MCP - Model Context Protocol) et des communications inter-agents (A2A).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implémenter des stratégies avancées de chunking et de re-ranking pour prioriser les règles spécifiques au domaine RH.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer à l&#39;optimisation des coûts, de la latence et de l&#39;efficacité globale du système en lien avec les équipes Plateforme et Infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualité, Évaluation &amp;amp; Observabilité (LLMOps)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développer et maintenir la couche de qualité du pipeline RAG multi-agents (Vertex AI Search / Discovery Engine).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer le grounding (ancrage) des réponses et la vérification des citations pour garantir la traçabilité vers une source de vérité.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mettre en place des pipelines d&#39;observabilité robustes pour l&#39;évaluation online et offline (OpenTelemetry, MLflow).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coder des évaluateurs automatiques basés sur des golden datasets pour itérer sereinement et prévenir les régressions avant chaque mise en production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intégrer des garde-fous (guardrails) pour protéger le système et les utilisateurs contre les hallucinations et les erreurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sécurité, Cloisonnement &amp;amp; Déploiement International&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access Management (ACLs) : Implémenter une gestion granulaire et dynamique des droits d&#39;accès au niveau de l&#39;indexation et du retrieval, garantissant qu&#39;un collaborateur n&#39;accède strictement qu&#39;aux documents RH de son périmètre.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Isolation &amp;amp; Multi-tenancy : Mettre en œuvre des stratégies de filtrage par métadonnées (metadata filtering) en base vectorielle et de cloisonnement (des index et/ou des modèles) pour assurer une étanchéité parfaite des données entre les différentes sociétés fiscales, entités légales et géographies de Decathlon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Multilingue : Contribuer à l&#39;architecture d&#39;internationalisation de DaiLY en adaptant les pipelines RAG, l&#39;embedding et l&#39;inférence pour maintenir un haut niveau de performance et de pertinence sur une grande diversité de langues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produit &amp;amp; Impact Business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aider à l&#39;analyse des intentions des utilisateurs pour mesurer l&#39;impact de DaiLY.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Traduire, avec l&#39;appui de la Product Manager et du Lead, les enjeux métier en comportements de modèles et en métriques de succès.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 PROFIL RECHERCHE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recherchons un profil justifiant a minima d’une première expérience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience :&lt;/strong&gt; Profil confirmé justifiant de plusieurs années d&#39;expérience professionnelle en entreprise (hors stages et alternances) en AI Engineering, ML Engineering ou Software Engineering orienté IA. Vous justifiez également d&#39;au moins une expérience concrète et réussie de mise en production d&#39;un système GenAI ou agentique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stack Technique&lt;/strong&gt; : Solide maîtrise de Python, de l&#39;écosystème GCP / Vertex AI, et des frameworks d&#39;orchestration (LangChain, LlamaIndex ou ADK).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expertise LLM &amp;amp; Agentique &lt;/strong&gt;: Solide maîtrise des architectures RAG (recherche vectorielle, Vertex AI Vector Search, gestion avancée de métadonnées), mais surtout des concepts techniques agentiques : function/tool-calling, boucles de raisonnement (ReAct, etc.), orchestration de workflows multi-agents, structured output et gestion du contexte/mémoire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualité &amp;amp; Évaluation&lt;/strong&gt; : Capacité à diagnostiquer une réponse incorrecte (problème de modèle, de &lt;em&gt;retrieval&lt;/em&gt; ou de données) et appétence pour l&#39;observabilité applicative (SQL / BigQuery / MLflow).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Langues &lt;/strong&gt;: Anglais professionnel courant (environnement international).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Les plus :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connaissance technique approfondie des protocoles A2A (Agent-to-Agent) et MCP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expérience de traitement multimodal de documents ou dans des écosystèmes SIRH (ex: Workday).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compréhension technique des enjeux de sécurité (RBAC, ACLs, RGPD) appliqués aux LLMs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connaissance des architectures microservices et conception d&#39;APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎁 CE QUE NOUS PROPOSONS&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;L&#39;opportunité de développer un produit d&#39;IA agentique de pointe avec un impact direct sur le quotidien de 100 000 collaborateurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un environnement technologique premium (Stack Google Cloud / Vertex AI / Databricks).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une politique de télétravail flexible (2 jours par semaine en remote, le reste dans nos bureaux à Paris - Canal de l’Ourcq).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une culture du &lt;em&gt;delivery&lt;/em&gt; axée sur l&#39;autonomie, l&#39;intelligence collective et la montée en compétences (accompagnement par un Lead, certifications, formations).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Des avantages attractifs (primes mensuelles/trimestrielles, actionnariat salarié).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une ambiance résolument tournée vers le sport (nombreuses corpos, tests produits, pauses déjeuner sportives ou non, …)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team: We are looking for a Solutions Engineer to join our team in Paris!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Solutions Engineer will report directly to the EMEA Solution Engineer Manager, and will play a pivotal role in helping prospects understand the value of DataDome for their business. This position is not just about technical expertise—it’s about becoming a trusted partner to clients, guiding them from introductory and demo discussions, through to production implementation. As a Solutions Engineer, you will collaborate closely with AEs/AMs and clients to solve complex challenges, understand pain points and establish success criteria in order to deliver tailored solutions that drive real-world impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is more than a technical role—it’s an opportunity to sit alongside clients as a strategic partner, contributing energy, ideas, and expertise to solve the hardest problems in our industry. Every day will bring new challenges and opportunities to expand your technical expertise, advocate for clients, and make a lasting impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will be more specifically in charge of…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding complex customer business problems and advise them on how to deploy the DataDome solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visualizing customer internal systems and information topology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading technical discussion with prospects in defining challenges and identifying client success criteria&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparing and delivering high impact presentations and demos that tell DataDome&#39;s differentiated story&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guiding customers through the evaluation process ensuring that DataDome&#39;s solution meets key business objectives and technical requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configuring prospect&#39;s instance to enhance bot detection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working cross-functionally between different sales, engineering, product and marketing teams to promote the adoption of the DataDome solution and share customer feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with the Account Executive team to assess, qualify and track customer opportunities in SalesForce, and contribute to the design of effective technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It would be great if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s Degree in Computer Science/Engineering or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least &lt;strong&gt;5 years pre-sales experience within an enterprise level SaaS ecosystem. Cybersecurity experience is not necessary, but appreciated.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A consultative approach with solving the customer’s business challenges and have a track record of successfully overcoming technical and security objections and highlighting product value as a whole&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in translating technical concepts into language for varied audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of web-based solutions, website development and structured data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly analytical mindset, that can manage client relationships as part of a market leading, AI driven organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer oriented with excellent written and verbal communication skills, as well project management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are interested in deep diving into data and you are familiar with Kibana/Elasticsearch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with Apache, Nginx, Varnish, IIS, lambda@edge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;discussion-id-31f95671-66d2-8029-bd3e-001c551b69bb notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flex Life&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;discussion-id-31f95671-66d2-8029-bd3e-001c551b69bb notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;While we offer hybrid options, this position requires 3 days per week in our Paris office, located next to the Opera Garnier. You will also receive a 500€ stipend to help you set up your ideal workspace&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generous Health Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;Employees are covered by statutory health insurance (or private insurance if eligible), with contributions shared between employee and employer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Social Security:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Full coverage under the German social security system, including statutory pension insurance, unemployment insurance, and long-term care insurance, with contributions shared between employee and employer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Accident Insurance :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Full coverage for work-related accidents and occupational diseases, 100% covered by the employer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;#Growth is part of our DNA, therefore we provide an annual stipend to invest in yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Events &amp;amp; Teambuilding:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Feel the #TeamSpirit both virtually &amp;amp; onsite, with several events &amp;amp; workshops planned throughout the year, including two annual offsite events, summer &amp;amp; winter parties, lunch &amp;amp; learns, &amp;amp; much more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Parent Care:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Gift &amp;amp; care packages for parents. Employees also benefit from mandatory parental leave and job protection in line with local regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PTO :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Includes a minimum of 20 paid vacation days per year (based on a 5-day work week), plus public holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are the next steps?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If your application is selected, our Talent Acquisition Manager will contact you for a first chat&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will then meet with Ahmed our Solution Engineer Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will do a 1h work session on typical client situations with our Head of sales and our SE team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will meet Chris our Chief Revenue Officer based in the US&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The final step will be a meeting with Benjamin our CEO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Welcome to DataDome!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About DataDome:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DataDome delivers real-time bot and agent trust management, giving businesses complete visibility and control over all traffic—human, bot, or AI. Named a Leader in The Forrester Wave™ for Bot Management, DataDome is trusted by enterprises like Etsy, PayPal, and Soundcloud. Acting as a traffic control plane, DataDome&#39;s multi-layered AI engine leverages thousands of models and 5 trillion signals daily to analyze intent and stop fraud in under 2 milliseconds—letting legitimate users through seamlessly across websites, apps, APIs, and MCPs. Backed by a 24/7 SOC and expert threat researchers, DataDome stops 20k+ attacks every second. With 30+ global PoPs, and 50+ ready-made integrations, DataDome is a recognized Leader on G2 across several categories—delivering protection that outperforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;DataDome is an equal opportunity employer, and proud to be committed to diversity and inclusion. We will consider all qualified applicants without regard to race, color, nationality, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, disability or age.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DataDome delivers real-time bot and agent trust management, giving businesses complete visibility and control over all traffic—human, bot, or AI. Named a Leader in The Forrester Wave™ for Bot And Agent Trust Management Q2 2026, DataDome is trusted by enterprises like Etsy, PayPal, and Soundcloud. Acting as a traffic control plane, DataDome&#39;s multi-layered AI engine leverages thousands of models and 5 trillion signals daily to analyze intent and stop fraud in under 2 milliseconds—letting legitimate users through seamlessly across websites, apps, APIs, and MCPs. Backed by a 24/7 SOC and expert threat researchers, DataDome stops 20k+ attacks every second. With 30+ global PoPs, and 80+ ready-made integrations, DataDome is a recognized Leader on G2 across several categories—delivering protection that outperforms.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⭐ &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DataDome&#39;s Integrations team&lt;/strong&gt; is responsible for delivering the software components integrated by our customers to send traffic to DataDome for analysis and run challenges on clients identified as threats. The team is currently made up of &lt;strong&gt;8 engineers (server-side and client-side)&lt;/strong&gt; and is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; who thrives on technical challenges and will help us develop new integrations and improve our current ones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will contribute to our roadmap with your teammates and work in strong collaboration with product managers and engineers across different teams (Tech, Customer Experience, Solutions Engineering).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;👤 &lt;strong&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer (Integrations)…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔑 You will be in charge of:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Developing and maintaining DataDome&#39;s JavaScript Tag&lt;/strong&gt;, our client-side integration deployed across hundreds of customer websites, with a focus on performance, resilience, security, and privacy. You will care about Core Web Vitals and the impact of our tag on customer pages. This will be your primary area of focus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building and improving server-side integration modules&lt;/strong&gt; for JavaScript-based edge platforms and runtimes such as &lt;strong&gt;AWS Lambda@Edge, Cloudflare Workers, Fastly Compute&lt;/strong&gt;, Node.js, and others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Taking ownership of backend integration modules&lt;/strong&gt; in other languages (Python, Go, Java, Ruby), helping customers integrate DataDome into their server-side infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving technical direction and best practices&lt;/strong&gt; for integration components, and mentoring other engineers on the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raising the bar on code quality and release standards&lt;/strong&gt; by driving improvements in CI/CD pipelines, testing, performance, and security across all integration components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Providing technical expertise&lt;/strong&gt; to our Support and Solutions Engineering teams (Tier 2/3) to help onboard customers and resolve complex integration challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Staying on the cutting edge&lt;/strong&gt; by monitoring technological developments in web technologies, edge computing, and server-side runtimes, and proposing improvements to our integrations accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Managing incidents and post-incident reviews&lt;/strong&gt; related to integration components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;🎯 &lt;strong&gt;You will be the perfect candidate if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have &lt;strong&gt;at least 5 years of professional software engineering experience&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have &lt;strong&gt;strong JavaScript/TypeScript skills&lt;/strong&gt;, including familiarity with modern web standards and server-side JS runtimes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have &lt;strong&gt;solid working proficiency in at least one other backend language&lt;/strong&gt; (Python, Go, Java, Ruby).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a good understanding of &lt;strong&gt;web protocols and standards&lt;/strong&gt; (HTTP, TCP, cookies, DNS, TLS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are able to &lt;strong&gt;assess trade-offs across different integration approaches&lt;/strong&gt; and propose solutions that scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience &lt;strong&gt;mentoring other engineers or driving technical decisions&lt;/strong&gt; within a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Care about &lt;strong&gt;performance, code quality, and automation&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked with &lt;strong&gt;CI/CD tools&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable working across different &lt;strong&gt;codebases, languages, and platforms&lt;/strong&gt; rather than specializing in a single stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are willing to &lt;strong&gt;learn and adopt new technologies&lt;/strong&gt; regularly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have good &lt;strong&gt;communication skills&lt;/strong&gt; and are fluent in &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are a &lt;strong&gt;team player&lt;/strong&gt; who enjoys collaborating with others and contributing to a supportive team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;📈 &lt;strong&gt;Bonus points if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with &lt;strong&gt;edge computing platforms&lt;/strong&gt; (Cloudflare Workers, AWS Lambda@Edge, Fastly Compute, Deno Deploy, Vercel Edge Functions, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked with &lt;strong&gt;CDNs, load balancers, or web servers&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with &lt;strong&gt;cloud providers&lt;/strong&gt; such as AWS or GCP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the inner workings of &lt;strong&gt;browsers and JavaScript engines&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are familiar with &lt;strong&gt;ECMAScript and Web standards&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with &lt;strong&gt;security topics&lt;/strong&gt; such as CSP, iframe sandboxing, bot detection, or web application security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked on &lt;strong&gt;compilers and/or parsers&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have prior experience in &lt;strong&gt;cryptography&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have developed your own &lt;strong&gt;bots&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;🚀 &lt;strong&gt;Career path&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is designed to grow into a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; position within the Integrations team. You will progressively take on broader technical ownership across the team&#39;s scope, influence architectural decisions, and become a key technical reference for both internal teams and customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;By joining DataDome, you will have access to:&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flex Life:&lt;/strong&gt; This position is &lt;strong&gt;open to fully remote candidates based anywhere in France&lt;/strong&gt;. You can also work from our Parisian office located next to the Opera Garnier, or go hybrid. You will receive a 500€ stipend to help you set up your ideal workspace if you work hybrid or remotely.
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you are full remote, the SNCF discount card is paid for you to come to our office to visit us &amp;amp; your team!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generous Health Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; We have partnered with Kenko for your healthcare needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 100€ annual allowance is provided for a leisure activity of your choice in Sports or Culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual allowance of 200€ if you come to the office by bike to cover maintenance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Development&lt;/strong&gt;: #WeAimHigh is part of our DNA, therefore we have invested in an internal Learning and Development platform and offer the opportunity to request additional training and support via your manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Events &amp;amp; Team building:&lt;/strong&gt; Feel the Team Spirit both virtually and onsite, with several events and workshops planned throughout the year, including an annual offsite event, quarterly online and offline events and parties, lunch &amp;amp; learns, and much more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Parent Care:&lt;/strong&gt; Gift &amp;amp; care packages for parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PTO:&lt;/strong&gt; Based on the country you are based in (e.g. 25 days in France).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are the next steps?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Talent Acquisition Manager will contact you for a first chat&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will then meet with Dara (Engineering Manager)&lt;/li&gt;
