&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Superpower&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;14:1-23:83;848-1641&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;27:1-27:66;1663-1728&quot;&gt;You combine entrepreneurial thinking with a strong client focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;28:1-28:88;1729-1816&quot;&gt;You move confidently at the C-level and build trust through personality and expertise&lt;/li&gt;
