&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Das bieten wir dir:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life-Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Mit unseren flexiblen Arbeitszeiten &amp;amp; Remote Work gestaltest du deinen Alltag so, wie er zu dir passt. Außerdem kannst du Überstunden ausgleichen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vacation mode on&lt;/strong&gt;: Du erhältst 18 Urlaubstage plus einen flexiblen Tag – zusätzlich sind der 24. und 31.12. frei.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing first:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Gesundheitsleistungen, attraktive Altersvorsorge sowie Mental Health Awareness Days stellen deine Gesundheit in den Mittelpunkt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice makes perfect&lt;/strong&gt;: Entfalte dich mit unseren vielfältigen Weiterbildungen und nutze unsere internen Karriereprogramme für deine Entwicklung im WPP-Netzwerk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More than just a job&lt;/strong&gt;: Dich erwarten unvergessliche Events, Mitarbeitendenrabatte und weitere Highlights wie das Job Ticket, Wellhub oder das Job Bike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be yourself&lt;/strong&gt;: Bei uns ist jede:r herzlich willkommen - Vielfalt und Chancengleichheit liegen uns am Herzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das bewegst du:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als &lt;strong&gt;Werkstudent&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;(Mensch) Planning Außenwerbung&lt;/strong&gt; arbeitest du für hochkarätige Kunden an vielfältigen Projekten im Bereich Out of Home und sammelst wertvolle Erfahrungen.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recherche &amp;amp; Datenmanagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Die Erforschung neuer OOH-Medien und Trends sowie die Datenpflege zu Zielgruppen, Standorten und Potenzialen sind Teil deines Aufgabenbereichs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyse &amp;amp; Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; In deiner Verantwortung liegt die datenbasierte Medienauswertung und die Erstellung monatlicher Markt-Reportings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mediaplanung &amp;amp; Support: &lt;/strong&gt;Du unterstützt aktiv bei der Erstellung und Pflege von Mediaplänen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Präsentationen &amp;amp; Dokumentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Die Erstellung von Präsentationen und Entscheidungsgrundlagen fällt in deinen Aufgabenbereich.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kommunikation &amp;amp; Koordination:&lt;/strong&gt; Die Sicherstellung des Informationsflusses, die SharePoint-Verwaltung und die Teamabstimmung gehören zu deinen Kernaufgaben.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prozessoptimierung:&lt;/strong&gt; Die Analyse und Verbesserung interner Abläufe ist außerdem ein wichtiger Teil deiner Tätigkeit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das zeichnet dich aus:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Studium &amp;amp; Verfügbarkeit:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du bist noch mindestens ein Jahr immatrikuliert und hast ca. 20 Stunden pro Woche Zeit, um uns zu unterstützen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interesse an OOH:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du hast Spaß am Medium Out of Home – sowohl an klassischer Außenwerbung als auch an digitalen Formaten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arbeitsweise:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du arbeitest gerne im Team, bist engagiert, zuverlässig und übernimmst Verantwortung für deine Aufgaben.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Umgang mit Daten:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Der Umgang mit Zahlen liegt dir, und du bereitest Daten und Ergebnisse gerne strukturiert in Präsentationen auf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tool-Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Du gehst sicher mit den gängigen MS-Office-Programmen um - insbesondere mit Excel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sprachkenntnisse:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Du verfügst über sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse in Wort und Schrift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Darüber hinaus bist du:&lt;strong&gt; #teamorientiert #kommunikativ #zuverlässig&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wenn du diesen Job spannend findest, dann ermutigen wir dich ausdrücklich zur Bewerbung, auch wenn du nicht jede oben gelistete Qualifikation aufweisen kannst.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Arbeiten bei WPP Media:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als WPP Media gestalten wir die Zukunft der Medien und investieren dabei konsequent in unsere Mitarbeiter:innen. Jede:r Kolleg:in genießt die Vorteile des globalen Netzwerks von WPP Media und WPP, um sich weiterzuentwickeln&amp;nbsp;und an der Spitze von Marketing und Werbung zu lernen. Vielfalt und Zusammenhalt leben wir durch zahlreiche Employee Resource Groups und regelmäßige interne Events - zum Austausch, zur Inspiration und zum gemeinsamen Feiern unserer Erfolge.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;WPP Media ist ein Arbeitgeber, der Chancengleichheit fördert. Wir berücksichtigen alle Bewerber:innen für alle Positionen ohne Diskriminierung. Unser Ziel ist eine Kultur des Respekts und der Zugehörigkeit, in der jede:r die gleichen Möglichkeiten hat, sich einzubringen und beruflich zu wachsen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bitte lies unsere &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Datenschutzerklärung&lt;/a&gt; für Deutschland, Österreich und die Schweiz, um weitere Informationen darüber zu erhalten, wie wir die von dir bereitgestellten Daten verarbeiten.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is building a global practice for Managed Service Providers from zero: The program, the proposition, and the wins that prove it out. As Senior Solutions Architect, MSP, you&#39;re the technical front line: helping define how Everpure goes to market with MSPs, then taking that straight to the field to win deals. You&#39;ll work shoulder-to-shoulder with MSP architects and their end customers, fluent in cost-per-tenant economics one minute and whiteboarding architecture the next. There&#39;s no playbook yet; you&#39;ll be building it and proving it, deal by deal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own technical leadership of MSP opportunities end to end: discovery, solution design, sizing, competitive positioning, POCs and technical close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the end-to-end service architecture — multi-tenancy, automation, provisioning, operational model and integration into the MSP&#39;s existing stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model and influence the commercial construct: unit economics, cost per tenant, Evergreen//One and consumption models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Displace competitors in MSP environments and position the full platform — FlashArray, FlashBlade, Portworx and Everpure Data Intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build technical credibility with MSP architects, practice leads and CTOs, growing a population of partner-side technical champions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed real MSP requirements back into the global MSP programme and Product Management, contributing reusable IP — reference architectures, sizing guides, service blueprints — from live engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in pre-sales, solutions architecture or technical leadership, with a demonstrable record of winning partner-led business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience with MSPs, with a real understanding of how they build, price, operate and sell a managed service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Credible at depth across modern data platform architecture: block, file and object, hybrid and cloud data services, Kubernetes and storage-as-a-service models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial fluency — comfortable discussing consumption economics, TCO and margin with an MSP&#39;s finance and practice leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding written, diagrammatic and verbal communication, with the executive presence to move between a CTO conversation and a whiteboard session.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial and ambitious — comfortable building a practice rather than inheriting one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/&quot;&gt;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/ &lt;/a&gt;for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACCOMMODATIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates with disabilities may request accommodations for all aspects of our hiring process. For more on this, contact us at &lt;a ---------- if you’re invited to an interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO A STRONG AND INCLUSIVE TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re forging a future where everyone finds their rightful place and where every voice matters. Where uniqueness isn’t just accepted but embraced. That’s why we are committed to fostering the growth and development of every person, cultivating a sense of community through our Employee Resource Groups and advocating for inclusive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, sexual stereotypes, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or any other characteristic legally protected by the laws of the jurisdiction in which you are being considered for hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us and bring your best.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring your bold.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure and simple.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agile Robots SE is an innovative company with a clear mission: bringing intelligent robotic solutions to our customers. We combine the latest technology in the field of AI with powerful robotic systems — from industrial robot arms and mobile manipulators to humanoids — to solve tasks that classical automation cannot address.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our solutions are deployed with international customers across a wide range of industries. Seamless integration and scalable deployment are at the core of our mission. Every one of these solutions starts as physical hardware — robotic workcells that we design, build, and commission in our own labs before they go into production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a passionate Senior Mechanical Engineer for Robotic Systems to turn robotics concepts into reliable physical systems. In this role, you will design the mechanical parts of our workcells, build and assemble them in our labs, and make sure they meet the relevant safety standards. You will own our lab infrastructure, tooling, and material, and be the hands-on partner for our robotics, software, and application engineers. The role is based in Munich, Germany.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design mechanical parts, fixtures, grippers, mounts, and enclosures for the robotic workcells in our labs and in customer projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate workcell and production line concepts in simulation — reachability, collisions, and cycle times — before any hardware is built&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Construct, assemble, and commission complete robotic workcells — from the frame and mounting concept to cabling and final integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain CAD models, technical drawings, and bills of materials, and prepare parts for manufacturing via CAM and 3D printing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build up a library of reusable mechanical modules, standard components, and design templates, and feed lessons learned from existing workcells back into it, so that each new cell is faster to design than the last&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the organization of our labs, including tools, equipment, material stock, and the procurement of mechanical components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that our workcells adhere to the relevant machine safety norms and support risk assessments, safeguarding concepts, and technical documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with robotics, software, and application engineers to translate application requirements into robust mechanical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to customer and deployment sites to support the installation, commissioning, and on-site adaptation of workcells (up to 20% of working time)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Essential Skills&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Mechanical Engineering, Mechatronics, or a related field — or equivalent practical experience, e.g. a technical apprenticeship with several years of relevant work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of four years of professional experience in mechanical design, machine building, or industrial automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid CAD skills (e.g., SolidWorks, Fusion 360, Inventor, Creo) for part and assembly design including technical drawings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with robot simulation and offline programming environments (e.g., RoboDK, RobotStudio, Visual Components)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with CAM and common manufacturing processes (milling, turning, sheet metal) as well as with 3D printing, including design for manufacturability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with aluminum profile systems, linear axes, fixtures, and standard mechanical components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with robotic hardware (robot arms, grippers, cameras, AGVs, sensors, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on mindset — you enjoy building, assembling, and commissioning hardware yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of machine safety norms and a structured approach to safe workcell design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured and independent working style with a strong sense of order in the lab&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Beneficial Skills&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of electrical engineering: wiring, control cabinets, and the integration of sensors and actuators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with pneumatics: valves, cylinders, vacuum grippers, and air supply&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with functional safety standards and safety equipment (e.g., EN ISO 10218, ISO/TS 15066, EN ISO 13849, safety scanners, light curtains, emergency stop circuits)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with external manufacturing suppliers and in procurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic programming skills (e.g., Python) or experience with PLC programming&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German language skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 TranslationField-module__aboutUsWrapper___WXJpq&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A dynamic high-tech company, combined with financial soundness and world-class investors.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Join an interdisciplinary, international team with 60+ different nationalities in a collaborative work environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lots of development opportunities as we continue to grow.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Challenging tasks and impactful projects alongside experts that enable professional and personal growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Corporate Benefits Program covering health, mobility, and learning for 100€ net per month.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Modern office facilities with a rooftop terrace overlooking Munich, free drinks &amp;amp; fruits, and regular company events contribute to a good working environment&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemValue___c0djd&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Robots SE&lt;/strong&gt; is an international high-tech company based in Munich, Germany with a production site in Kaufbeuren and more than &lt;strong&gt;3500&lt;/strong&gt; employees worldwide. Our mission is to bridge the gap between artificial intelligence and robotics by developing systems that combine state-of-the-art force-moment-sensing and world-leading image-processing technology. This unique combination of technologies allows us to provide user-friendly and affordable robotic solutions that enable intelligent precision assembly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is made possible by our employees, who bring out the best in each and every day with creativity and enthusiasm. Become part of this team and shape the future of robotics with us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud of our diversity and welcome your application regardless of gender and sexual identity, nationality, ethnicity, religion, age, or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;About the role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We are currently looking for a Senior Finance BP to join our team. The ideal candidate should possess a strong analytical mindset and be able to work collaboratively with our finance team to support our business operations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the budgeting, forecasting, and long-range planning processes for assigned business units&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Collaborate closely with functional and operational leaders to support decision-making&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;and cost control&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Develop financial models to evaluate business scenarios, investments, and pricing. Provide financial insights to optimize revenue, cost efficiency, and profitability&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Analyze monthly performance, providing profitability analysis and actionable recommendations for projects and products with margin optimization and cost management&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to develop and manage cost budgets. Lead in the preparation of cost forecasts, providing insights into potential cost fluctuations, and handling cost control for projects and products&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Support business cases for new products, projects, and market expansions&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Partner with accounting and FP&amp;amp;A teams to maintain compliance with corporate and regulatory standards&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
